#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "エンドポイント"
msgstr "Endpoint"

#: src/index.md
msgid "`POST /api/pages?project=&key=&kind=&role=&workspace=`"
msgstr "`POST /api/pages?project=&key=&kind=&role=&workspace=`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"本文は HTML。番号を決めて `201` と JSON を返す。`n`・`created_at` は取り込み"
"の時だけ付け、番号が使われていれば `409`"
msgstr ""
"The body is HTML. Assigns a number and returns `201` with JSON. `n` and "
"`created_at` are given only on import; if the number is already in use, "
"returns `409`"

#: src/index.md src/next.md
msgid "`GET /api/pages`"
msgstr "`GET /api/pages`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"`project`・`key`・`kind`・`role`・`workspace`・`q`・`sort`・`limit`・"
"`before`・`after` で絞る。`{\"pages\":[…]}`"
msgstr ""
"Filter by `project`, `key`, `kind`, `role`, `workspace`, `q`, `sort`, "
"`limit`, `before`, and `after`. Returns `{\"pages\":[…]}`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "`DELETE /api/pages?project=[&key=][&kind=][&n=]`"
msgstr "`DELETE /api/pages?project=[&key=][&kind=][&n=]`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"合うページを消し、番号を表 `removed` に残して、消した path の一覧を返す。`n` "
"には `key` と `kind` が要る。人は見分けない（だれが消してよいかは、呼ぶ側が決"
"める）"
msgstr ""
"Deletes the matching pages, keeps their numbers in the `removed` table, and "
"returns the list of deleted paths. `n` requires `key` and `kind`. It does "
"not tell people apart (the caller decides who may delete)"

#: src/index.md
msgid "`GET /<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html`"
msgstr "`GET /<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "本文。無ければ `404`、消したページは `410`"
msgstr "The body. `404` if it does not exist, `410` for a deleted page"

#: src/index.md
msgid "`POST /api/files?project=&key=&name=&role=&workspace=`"
msgstr "`POST /api/files?project=&key=&name=&role=&workspace=`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"本文は file の中身（`Content-Type` が要る）。`name` は `<語>.<拡張子>` で、番"
"号を決めて `201` と JSON を返す。受けない種類は `415`、16 MiB を超えれば "
"`413`"
msgstr ""
"The body is the file contents (`Content-Type` is required). `name` is "
"`<stem>.<ext>`; the server picks the number and returns `201` with JSON. "
"Types not accepted get `415`, and over 16 MiB gets `413`"

#: src/index.md src/next.md
msgid "`GET /api/files`"
msgstr "`GET /api/files`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"`project`・`key`・`role`・`workspace`・`q`・`sort`・`limit`・`before`・"
"`after` で絞る。`{\"files\":[…]}`"
msgstr ""
"Filter by `project`, `key`, `role`, `workspace`, `q`, `sort`, `limit`, "
"`before`, and `after`. Returns `{\"files\":[…]}`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "`DELETE /api/files?project=[&key=][&name=][&n=]`"
msgstr "`DELETE /api/files?project=[&key=][&name=][&n=]`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"合う file を消し、番号を表 `files_removed` に残して、消した path の一覧を返"
"す。人は見分けない"
msgstr ""
"Deletes the matching files, keeps their numbers in the `files_removed` "
"table, and returns the list of deleted paths. It does not tell people apart"

#: src/index.md
msgid "`GET /<project>/<key>/files/<語>-<n>.<拡張子>`"
msgstr "`GET /<project>/<key>/files/<stem>-<n>.<ext>`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "file の中身。無ければ `404`、消した file は `410`"
msgstr "The file contents. `404` if missing, `410` if the file was deleted"

#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "`GET /`・`/<project>/`・`/<project>/<key>/`"
msgstr "`GET /`, `/<project>/`, `/<project>/<key>/`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "一覧の UI（絞った一覧）"
msgstr "List UI (filtered list)"

#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/events`"
msgstr "`GET /api/events`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "置かれるたびに 1 件を push（SSE。file は `event: file`）"
msgstr ""
"Pushes one record each time something is placed (SSE; files use `event: "
"file`)"

#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/backup`"
msgstr "`GET /api/backup`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "DB の写し"
msgstr "DB backup"

#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/version`"
msgstr "`GET /api/version`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"サーバーの版と API の版（`{\"version\":\"0.2.0\",\"api\":1}`）。どの答えにも "
"header `Pagetray-Api` が付く"
msgstr ""
"Server version and API version (`{\"version\":\"0.2.0\",\"api\":1}`). Every "
"response carries the `Pagetray-Api` header"

#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "`GET /healthz`"
msgstr "`GET /healthz`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "生きているか"
msgstr "Whether it is alive"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"**この Mac の中からだけ**: `Host` が `127.0.0.1`・`localhost` でない要求と、"
"`Origin` の付いた書く要求は断る。例外は、一覧の UI が同じ `Origin` から file "
"を上げる `POST /api/files` だけ（役割は `product-manager` で記録する。[API の"
"仕様](api.md) の「共通」）。"
msgstr ""
"**Only from this Mac**: requests whose `Host` is not `127.0.0.1` or "
"`localhost`, and write requests that carry an `Origin`, are rejected. The "
"one exception is `POST /api/files` from the list UI at the same `Origin`, to "
"upload a file (recorded with the role `product-manager`; see \"Common "
"rules\" in the [API specification](api.md))."

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"**種類と役割の名**: 一覧は持たない。字の形（英小文字で始まり、英小文字・数"
"字・`-` で 32 字まで）だけを見る。"
msgstr ""
"**Kind and role names**: no list of names is kept. Only the form is checked "
"(starts with a lowercase letter; lowercase letters, digits, and `-`; up to "
"32 characters)."

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"**一覧の UI**: サーバーが HTML を組んで返す。絞り込み・並べ替え・検索は link "
"と form で、条件は URL に出る（script が無くても動く）。script がするのは、"
"ページが置かれた時に一覧の列と絞り込みの列をサーバーが組んだ HTML に差し替え"
"ること（本文の枠は読み込み直さない）と、新着の印・未読の印（browser が覚え"
"る）・時刻をこの Mac の時刻で出すことと、file を上げることだけ。画面は 4 つの"
"区画（操作の帯・絞り込みの列・一覧の列・本文の枠）でできていて、選んだページ"
"は、本文の枠（`sandbox` を付けた iframe）に 1 枚だけ出す。Key の画面"
"（project と Key を 1 つずつ選んだ時）には、file の枠と上げる枠が足される"
"（[動かす](run.md) の「一覧の UI から file を上げる」）。語の意味は [用語集]"
"(glossary.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**List UI**: the server builds the HTML and returns it. Filtering, sorting, "
"and search use links and forms, and the conditions appear in the URL (it "
"works without script). The script only replaces the list column and the "
"filter column with HTML built by the server when a page is put (it does not "
"reload the viewer), and handles the new-arrival marks, the unread marks "
"(remembered by the browser), showing times in this Mac's time, and uploading "
"files. The screen is made of four regions (the toolbar, the filter column, "
"the list column, and the viewer), and the selected page is shown, one at a "
"time, in the viewer (an iframe with `sandbox`). The Key view (one project "
"and one Key chosen) adds the file box and the upload box (see \"Uploading a "
"file from the list UI\" in [Running](run.md)). For what the terms mean, see "
"the [Glossary](glossary.md)."

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"**番号**: 書く接続は 1 本で、1 つの SQL が「今の最大 ＋ 1」を取って足す。最大"
"は、置いてあるページ（`pages`）と消したページ（`removed`）の両方から取るの"
"で、消した番号は 2 度使わない（古い URL が別のページを指さない）。取り込みで"
"消した番号を名指すと `409`。置いたページを書き換えるエンドポイントは無い。"
msgstr ""
"**Numbers**: there is a single write connection, and one SQL statement takes "
"\"the current maximum + 1\" and inserts it. The maximum is taken from both "
"the stored pages (`pages`) and the deleted pages (`removed`), so a deleted "
"number is never used twice (an old URL never points to a different page). "
"Naming a deleted number on import returns `409`. There is no endpoint for "
"rewriting a stored page."

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"**消す**: 1 つの取引で、`removed` に番号を写し、`pages_fts` と `pages` の行を"
"消す。本文は残さない（戻せない）。"
msgstr ""
"**Delete**: in a single transaction, copies the number into `removed` and "
"deletes the rows in `pages_fts` and `pages`. The body is not kept (it cannot "
"be restored)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"Apple Container（`container` CLI）で、release の image を動かす。`127.0.0.1` "
"だけで待ち受け、LAN にもインターネットにも開かない。"
msgstr ""
"Run the release image with Apple Container (the `container` CLI). It listens "
"only on `127.0.0.1` and is not open to the LAN or the internet."

#: src/run.md
msgid "物"
msgstr "Item"

#: src/run.md
msgid "値"
msgstr "Value"

#: src/run.md
msgid "image"
msgstr "image"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`ghcr.io/uraitakahito/pagetray:v<version>`（[release](https://github.com/"
"uraitakahito/pagetray/releases) に digest がある。arm64）"
msgstr ""
"`ghcr.io/uraitakahito/pagetray:v<version>` (the digest is in the [release]"
"(https://github.com/uraitakahito/pagetray/releases); arm64)"

#: src/run.md
msgid "container"
msgstr "container"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`pagetray`（`127.0.0.1:8801` と `127.0.0.1:8800` → 中の 8080。メモリは Apple "
"Container の下限の 200 MiB、CPU は 1）"
msgstr ""
"`pagetray` (`127.0.0.1:8801` and `127.0.0.1:8800` → 8080 inside. Memory is "
"200 MiB, the Apple Container minimum; CPU is 1)"

#: src/run.md
msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`http://127.0.0.1:8801/`（一覧の UI。ページは `/<project>/<key>/<kind>-"
"<n>.html`）。`8800` は、前の置き場（Nginx。今は無い）の port。前に置いたペー"
"ジの URL を同じ path で開けるように、同じ container が待ち受ける"
msgstr ""
"`http://127.0.0.1:8801/` (the list UI. Pages are at `/<project>/<key>/<kind>-"
"<n>.html`). `8800` is the port of the previous page store (Nginx; now gone). "
"The same container listens on it so that URLs of pages stored earlier open "
"at the same path"

#: src/run.md
msgid "DB"
msgstr "DB"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"名前つきの volume `pagetray-data-v1`（中の `/data/pages.db`。1.0.0 から。"
"0.8.x までの volume `pagetray-data` からは移す: [release を出す](release.md) "
"の「切り替え」）。Mac の folder は mount しない"
msgstr ""
"The named volume `pagetray-data-v1` (`/data/pages.db` inside; since 1.0.0. "
"Data is moved from the volume `pagetray-data` used up to 0.8.x: see \"The "
"switch-over\" in [Releasing](release.md)). No Mac folder is mounted"

#: src/run.md
msgid "記録"
msgstr "Logs"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"同じ volume の `/data/logs/`（0.7.0 から。合わせて 4 MiB と 64 KiB まで）。下"
"の「落ちた後に調べる」"
msgstr ""
"`/data/logs/` in the same volume (since 0.7.0; at most 4 MiB plus 64 KiB in "
"total). See \"Investigating after a crash\" below"

#: src/run.md src/cli.md src/release.md
msgid "設定"
msgstr "Settings"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"環境変数 `PAGETRAY_DB`（既定 `/data/pages.db`）・`PAGETRAY_LISTEN`（既定 "
"`0.0.0.0:8080`）。image の既定のままでよい。`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`（0.6.0 か"
"ら。既定は無し）と `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL`（0.6.0 から。既定 `http://"
"127.0.0.1:8802`）は下の「送り手を castlist に聞く」"
msgstr ""
"Environment variables `PAGETRAY_DB` (default `/data/pages.db`) and "
"`PAGETRAY_LISTEN` (default `0.0.0.0:8080`). The image defaults are fine as "
"is. For `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL` (since 0.6.0; no default) and "
"`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL` (since 0.6.0; default `http://127.0.0.1:8802`), "
"see \"Asking castlist for the sender\" below"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`roster` を使う Mac では、container と volume に触る命令を `roster infra run "
"pagetray -- <命令>` で打つ（この repo の `.claude/roles/config.jsonc` と、"
"roster の設定が、環境 `pagetray` を「TPM に相談」の手続きで宣言している）。下"
"の命令は、その頭を省いて書いてある。使う版は、roster の `.pagetray-version`"
"（roster の cli と合わせてある版）。"
msgstr ""
"On a Mac that uses `roster`, run commands that touch the container and the "
"volume as `roster infra run pagetray -- <command>` (this repo's `.claude/"
"roles/config.jsonc` and the roster settings declare the environment "
"`pagetray` with the \"consult the TPM\" procedure). The commands below are "
"written without that prefix. The version to use is the one in the roster "
"`.pagetray-version` (the version matched to the roster cli)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "送り手を castlist に聞く"
msgstr "Asking castlist for the sender"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"castlist の居場所は、2 つの環境変数で書く（どちらも `http://<host>:<port>` の"
"形だけ。後ろの `/` は無くてよい）。pagetray は container の中から castlist に"
"聞き、一覧の UI の link は Product Manager が host（pagetray を動かす機械）"
"の browser で開くので、同じ castlist でも届く所が違う。"
msgstr ""
"Where castlist is is set with two environment variables (both only in the "
"form `http://<host>:<port>`; a trailing `/` is optional). pagetray asks "
"castlist from inside its container, while the Product Manager opens the "
"links in the list UI in a browser on the host (the machine that runs "
"pagetray), so the same castlist is reached at different addresses."

#: src/run.md src/cli.md
msgid "環境変数"
msgstr "Environment variable"

#: src/run.md
msgid "使う所"
msgstr "Used for"

#: src/run.md
msgid "本番の値"
msgstr "Production value"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"pagetray が、container の中から castlist に送り手を聞く先。container の中の "
"`127.0.0.1` は container 自身なので、host の port には届かない"
msgstr ""
"Where pagetray asks castlist for senders, from inside the container. Inside "
"the container, `127.0.0.1` is the container itself, so it does not reach "
"ports on the host"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`http://castlist.box:8080`。castlist の container `castlist.box` の port "
"8080 に、名でつなぐ（既定の network では、Apple Container の DNS が domain "
"`box` の名を答える）"
msgstr ""
"`http://castlist.box:8080`. Connects by name to port 8080 of the castlist "
"container `castlist.box` (on the default network, Apple Container's DNS "
"answers names in the domain `box`)"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL`"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"一覧の UI の、送り手の名の link（`<値>/actors/<アクターの id>`）の頭。"
"Product Manager が host の browser で開く"
msgstr ""
"The base of the link on the sender's name in the list UI (`<value>/actors/"
"<actor id>`). The Product Manager opens it in a browser on the host"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`http://127.0.0.1:8802`（既定のまま。castlist は host の `127.0.0.1:8802` で"
"待ち受ける）"
msgstr ""
"`http://127.0.0.1:8802` (leave the default; castlist listens on "
"`127.0.0.1:8802` on the host)"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL` を書くと、付随する id を付けて置かれたページと file "
"の送り手を、受けたその時に castlist に聞いて残す（[API の仕様](api.md) の「送"
"り手」）。本番では、下の「起こす」の `container run` に `-e "
"PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL=http://castlist.box:8080` を足す。"
msgstr ""
"When `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL` is set, the store asks castlist for the sender "
"of each page and file put with an attached id at the moment it receives "
"them, and records the answer (\"Senders\" in the [API specification]"
"(api.md)). In production, add `-e PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL=http://"
"castlist.box:8080` to the `container run` in \"Start\" below."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"書かなければ、castlist に聞かず、付随する id だけを残す（一覧の UI では「未確"
"認」で、link も出ない）。"
msgstr ""
"If it is not set, castlist is not asked and only the attached id is recorded "
"(shown as \"unconfirmed\" in the list UI, with no link)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"書いた時は、castlist が止まっている・1 秒で答えない間、付随する id を付けた置"
"く要求は `503` で断られる（何も置かない）。付けない要求は前のまま置ける。"
msgstr ""
"If it is set, then while castlist is down or does not answer within 1 "
"second, put requests that carry an attached id are rejected with `503` "
"(nothing is stored). Requests without one are stored as before."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"一覧の UI の送り手の名は、`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL`（無ければ `http://"
"127.0.0.1:8802`）の `/actors/<アクターの id>` への link になる。聞く先の "
"`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL` からは作らない（聞く先は container の中から届く所で、"
"host の browser から開けるとは限らない）。"
msgstr ""
"In the list UI, the sender's name is a link to `/actors/<actor id>` on "
"`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL` (`http://127.0.0.1:8802` if not set). It is not "
"built from `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`, the address castlist is asked at (that "
"address is reachable from inside the container, and a browser on the host "
"may not be able to open it)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"どちらかの形が `http://<host>:<port>` でなければ、サーバーは起きない"
"（`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL` が無くても、書いた `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL` は"
"見る）。起きた時の log の頭の行の後ろに ` castlist=<聞く先> "
"castlist_link=<link の頭>` が付く。"
msgstr ""
"If either value is not in the form `http://<host>:<port>`, the server does "
"not start (a `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL` that is set is checked even "
"without `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`). On startup, ` castlist=<address asked> "
"castlist_link=<link base>` is appended to the first log line."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"castlist へは、つなぐ先に関わらず `Host: 127.0.0.1` で送る（castlist は "
"`Host` が `127.0.0.1`・`localhost` でない要求を断るので、`castlist.box` の名"
"でつないでも、`Host` は変えない）。"
msgstr ""
"Requests to castlist are always sent with `Host: 127.0.0.1`, whatever the "
"destination (castlist refuses requests whose `Host` is not `127.0.0.1` or "
"`localhost`, so `Host` stays the same even when connecting by the name "
"`castlist.box`)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "起こす"
msgstr "Start"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"'\"digest\" *: *\"sha256:[0-9a-f]*\"'   # release の digest がこの中にある"
"か\n"
msgstr ""
"'\"digest\" *: *\"sha256:[0-9a-f]*\"'   # is the release digest in here?\n"

#: src/run.md
msgid "# 初めての時だけ\n"
msgstr "# first time only\n"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"digest の見方: `container image list` に出る digest は、Apple Container が付"
"ける別の値。release の digest は、`container image inspect` の `variants` の"
"中の `digest` に出る。"
msgstr ""
"How to read the digest: the digest shown by `container image list` is a "
"different value assigned by Apple Container. The release digest appears as "
"`digest` inside `variants` in `container image inspect`."

#: src/run.md
msgid "`-p` には必ず `127.0.0.1:` を書く。`-p 8801:8080` と書くと LAN に開く。"
msgstr ""
"Always write `127.0.0.1:` in `-p`. Writing `-p 8801:8080` opens it to the "
"LAN."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"8801 が使われていたら別の port にする。roster の担当が使う URL は、環境変数 "
"`TPM_PAGES_URL` で合わせる。"
msgstr ""
"If 8801 is in use, pick another port. Match the URL used by the roster "
"agents with the environment variable `TPM_PAGES_URL`."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"0.8.x（volume `pagetray-data`）で動かしていた時は、`container volume create` "
"の前に [release を出す](release.md) の「切り替え」をする（新しい volume を作"
"り、写しを migrate で移してから、上の `container run` で起こす）。"
msgstr ""
"If you were running 0.8.x (volume `pagetray-data`), do \"The switch-over\" "
"in [Releasing](release.md) before `container volume create` (create the new "
"volume, move the copy with migrate, then start with the `container run` "
"above)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"起きる時に、まだ当てていない移行の SQL（`crates/server/migrations/`）を DB に"
"当てる。"
msgstr ""
"On start, it applies the migration SQL (`crates/server/migrations/`) that "
"has not yet been applied to the DB."

#: src/run.md
msgid "確かめる"
msgstr "Verify"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`container list` で `pagetray` が `running`。"
msgstr "`container list` shows `pagetray` as `running`."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`lsof -nP -iTCP:8801 -iTCP:8800 -sTCP:LISTEN` が `127.0.0.1:8801` と "
"`127.0.0.1:8800` だけを出す（`*:` で始まる行があれば LAN に開いている）。"
msgstr ""
"`lsof -nP -iTCP:8801 -iTCP:8800 -sTCP:LISTEN` prints only `127.0.0.1:8801` "
"and `127.0.0.1:8800` (a line starting with `*:` means it is open to the LAN)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/healthz` と `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8800/"
"healthz` が `{\"status\":\"ok\",\"version\":\"<version>\"}` を返す"
"（`version` が起こした版。1.0.0 から。0.8.x までは字の `ok` と `GET /api/"
"version`）。"
msgstr ""
"`curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/healthz` and `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8800/"
"healthz` return `{\"status\":\"ok\",\"version\":\"<version>\"}` (`version` "
"is the version you started; since 1.0.0. Up to 0.8.x it was the text `ok` "
"and `GET /api/version`)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`container logs pagetray` の頭の 2 行が、前回の終わり方（`previous: …`。下の"
"「落ちた後に調べる」）と、`pagetray <version> listen=0.0.0.0:8080 db=/data/"
"pages.db` で終わる行（0.7.0 から、どの行も頭に時刻と `INFO` などの重さが付"
"く。castlist に聞く時は、後ろに ` castlist=http://castlist.box:8080 "
"castlist_link=http://127.0.0.1:8802`）。"
msgstr ""
"The first two lines of `container logs pagetray` are how the previous run "
"ended (`previous: …`; see \"Investigating after a crash\" below) and a line "
"ending with `pagetray <version> listen=0.0.0.0:8080 db=/data/pages.db` "
"(since 0.7.0 every line starts with a timestamp and a level such as `INFO`; "
"when asking castlist, followed by ` castlist=http://castlist.box:8080 "
"castlist_link=http://127.0.0.1:8802`)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`container stats --no-stream pagetray` のメモリが数 MiB〜20 MiB ほど（初めて"
"起こした直後と、たくさん置いた直後は、OS が file を覚えている分で 50 MiB を超"
"えることがある。起こし直すと戻る）。"
msgstr ""
"Memory in `container stats --no-stream pagetray` is around a few MiB to 20 "
"MiB (right after the first start, and right after many pages are put, it can "
"exceed 50 MiB because of files the OS keeps cached. Restarting brings it "
"back down)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"一覧の UI を、読むだけの試験で見る（試験のある 0.3.2 から）。本物の browser"
"（この Mac の Chrome）で開き、一覧が出て API の答えと合うこと・新着の知らせに"
"つながること・絞れること・選んだページが本文の枠に出ること・console に誤りが"
"無いことを見る。置き場には何も書かない。pagetray の checkout のある folder "
"で、起こした版の試験を取り出して流す（Node と pnpm が要る。[開発]"
"(development.md) の「一覧の UI の試験」）。checkout が無ければ、browser で "
"`http://127.0.0.1:8801/` を開き、一覧が出るのを見る。"
msgstr ""
"Check the list UI with the read-only test (available from 0.3.2, the first "
"version that has the tests). It opens the UI in a real browser (the Chrome "
"on this Mac) and checks that the list appears and agrees with the API's "
"answer, that it connects to the new-page notices, that filtering works, that "
"the selected page appears in the viewer, and that there are no errors in the "
"console. It writes nothing to the store. In the folder that holds your "
"pagetray checkout, take out the tests of the version you started and run "
"them (Node and pnpm are needed; see \"List UI tests\" in [Development]"
"(development.md)). If you have no checkout, open `http://127.0.0.1:8801/` in "
"a browser and see that the list appears."

#: src/run.md
msgid "\"$PWD/pagetray-smoke\""
msgstr "\"$PWD/pagetray-smoke\""

#: src/run.md
msgid "http://127.0.0.1:8801"
msgstr "http://127.0.0.1:8801"

#: src/run.md
msgid "一覧の UI から file を上げる"
msgstr "Uploading a file from the list UI"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"人（Product Manager）が、画面の絵などを担当に渡す道。担当は `roster file "
"put` で上げる。"
msgstr ""
"The way for a person (the Product Manager) to hand screenshots and the like "
"to the roles. The roles upload with `roster file put`."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"browser で Key の画面（`http://127.0.0.1:8801/<project>/<key>/`。一覧で "
"project と Key の候補を 1 つずつ押してもよい）を開く。一覧の列の下に、file の"
"枠（その Key の file）と上げる枠が出る。"
msgstr ""
"Open the Key view in a browser (`http://127.0.0.1:8801/<project>/<key>/`; "
"you can also click one project choice and one Key choice in the list). Below "
"the list column, the file box (the files of that Key) and the upload box "
"appear."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"上げる枠で file を選ぶか、枠に落とす。受けるのは png・jpg・jpeg・gif・webp・"
"pdf・txt・log・md・csv・json で、1 つ 16 MiB まで（ほかは送る前に断る）。名"
"は、元の名から CLI と同じ作り方で付く（`Screen Shot 1.PNG` → `screen-"
"shot-1.png`）。"
msgstr ""
"Choose a file in the upload box, or drop it on the box. Accepted are png, "
"jpg, jpeg, gif, webp, pdf, txt, log, md, csv, and json, up to 16 MiB each "
"(anything else is refused before sending). The name is made from the "
"original name the same way as the CLI does (`Screen Shot 1.PNG` → `screen-"
"shot-1.png`)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"見本を見る（図はその図、字の file は頭の 20 行、PDF は名と大きさ）。token・"
"鍵・個人の情報・ほかの人の画面が写っていないかを見て、「秘密（token・鍵・個人"
"の情報・ほかの人の画面）が写っていないか見た」に印を付ける。印を付けるまで"
"「送る」は押せない。"
msgstr ""
"Look at the preview (an image shows itself, a text file its first 20 lines, "
"a PDF its name and size). Check that no token, key, personal information, or "
"other people's screens are in it, then tick \"I checked that no secrets "
"(tokens, keys, personal information, other people's screens) are in it\". "
"The send button stays disabled until you tick it."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"「送る」を押すと、ページから参照する path（`files/screen-shot-1-1.png` など）"
"が出て、file の枠に足される。この path を担当に伝える。"
msgstr ""
"Press send. The path a page uses to refer to the file (such as `files/screen-"
"shot-1-1.png`) is shown, and the file is added to the file box. Tell this "
"path to the role."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"一覧の UI から上げた file は、役割 `product-manager` で記録される（[API の仕"
"様](api.md) の「共通」）。"
msgstr ""
"A file uploaded from the list UI is recorded with the role `product-manager` "
"(see \"Common rules\" in the [API specification](api.md))."

#: src/run.md
msgid "画面から消すことはできない。消すのは TPM 担当に頼む。"
msgstr ""
"Files cannot be removed from the screen. Ask the TPM role to remove them."

#: src/run.md
msgid "上げるのには script が要る。script が無くても、file の枠は読める。"
msgstr ""
"Uploading needs script. Without script, the file box can still be read."

#: src/run.md
msgid "DB の写しを取る"
msgstr "Back up the DB"

#: src/run.md
msgid "**版を上げる前と、volume に触る前**に取る。動かしたまま取れる。"
msgstr ""
"Take one **before upgrading and before touching the volume**. It can be "
"taken while the server is running."

#: src/run.md
msgid "'select count(*) from pages'    # 開けて、件数が合うか\n"
msgstr ""
"'select count(*) from pages'    # does it open, and does the count match?\n"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"写しには、置かれたページの本文と、上げられた file（0.4.0 から）がみな入ってい"
"る。file の分だけ大きくなる。この repo にも CI にも置かない。"
msgstr ""
"The backup contains the bodies of all stored pages and all uploaded files "
"(from 0.4.0), so it grows by the size of the files. Do not put it in this "
"repo or in CI."

#: src/run.md
msgid "写しの中の表と列は [DB の作り](db.md) にある。"
msgstr ""
"The tables and columns inside the backup are described in [DB schema](db.md)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "上げてはいけない file を上げてしまった時"
msgstr "If you uploaded a file you should not have"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"秘密（token・鍵・個人の情報など）が写った file を上げてしまったら、TPM 担当"
"に URL を送って消してもらう（`roster file delete <URL> --yes`）。消しても、**"
"消す前に取った写しには残る**。消した後に写しを取り直し、それより前の写し（`~/"
"pagetray-*.db`）を消す。秘密そのもの（token・鍵）は、すぐ替える。"
msgstr ""
"If you uploaded a file that shows a secret (a token, a key, personal "
"information, and so on), send its URL to the TPM and have it deleted "
"(`roster file delete <URL> --yes`). Even after deletion, **it stays in any "
"backup taken before the deletion**. After deleting, take a new backup and "
"delete the older backups (`~/pagetray-*.db`). Replace the secret itself "
"(token or key) right away."

#: src/run.md
msgid "写しから戻す"
msgstr "Restore from a backup"

#: src/run.md
msgid "volume を失った・DB が壊れた時。戻す間、ページは置けない。"
msgstr ""
"For when the volume is lost or the DB is corrupted. Pages cannot be put "
"while restoring."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"動かす image は空で `cp` も無いので、file を volume に入れる時だけ、shell の"
"ある image を借りる（上は `Containerfile` の build の段と同じ物。何でもよ"
"い）。"
msgstr ""
"The image you run is empty and has no `cp`, so borrow an image with a shell "
"only for putting the file into the volume (the one above is the same as the "
"build stage of the `Containerfile`; any will do)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"起こしたら「確かめる」をし、`curl -s 'http://127.0.0.1:8801/api/pages?"
"maxResults=1'` で一番新しいページを見る。"
msgstr ""
"After starting, do \"Verify\" and look at the newest page with `curl -s "
"'http://127.0.0.1:8801/api/pages?maxResults=1'`."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"写しが無ければ、空の volume で起こす。`roster page import` が、控えの folder "
"のページを同じ番号で入れ直す（置いた役割の記録は戻らない）。"
msgstr ""
"If there is no backup, start with an empty volume. `roster page import` puts "
"the pages in the local copy folder back under the same numbers (the record "
"of which role put them is not restored)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "落ちた後に調べる"
msgstr "Investigating after a crash"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"0.7.0 から、pagetray は自分の終わり方と、時刻つきの記録を volume の `/data/"
"logs/` に残す。`container logs` は container を起こし直すと頭から書き直される"
"が、こちらは起こし直しても、版を上げても残る。"
msgstr ""
"Since 0.7.0, pagetray keeps a record of how it ended, and timestamped logs, "
"in `/data/logs/` on the volume. `container logs` starts over whenever the "
"container is restarted; these files survive restarts and upgrades."

#: src/run.md src/glossary.md
msgid "file"
msgstr "file"

#: src/run.md
msgid "上限"
msgstr "Limit"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`server.log`・`server.log.1`〜`server.log.3`"
msgstr "`server.log`, `server.log.1` to `server.log.3`"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"時刻（UTC）つきの行。`container logs` に出る行と、問い合わせごとの 1 行"
"（method・path・status・かかった時間）"
msgstr ""
"Timestamped (UTC) lines: the lines shown by `container logs`, plus one line "
"per request (method, path, status, time taken)"

#: src/run.md
msgid "1 つ 1 MiB、合わせて 4 MiB。超える前に回し、一番古い物を消す"
msgstr ""
"1 MiB each, 4 MiB in total. Rotated before the limit is exceeded; the oldest "
"file is deleted"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`runs.log`"
msgstr "`runs.log`"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"終わり方の印。起きた・止める合図を受けた・閉じ終えた・panic・誤りで終わった、"
"を 1 行ずつ"
msgstr ""
"Run marks, one line each: started, got a stop signal, finished closing, "
"panicked, failed"

#: src/run.md
msgid "64 KiB。超える前に、古い半分を落とす"
msgstr "64 KiB. The older half is dropped before the limit is exceeded"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`alive`"
msgstr "`alive`"

#: src/run.md
msgid "生きている印の時刻。30 秒ごとに上書きする"
msgstr "The time of the last heartbeat. Overwritten every 30 seconds"

#: src/run.md
msgid "数十 byte"
msgstr "A few dozen bytes"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"読むのは `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/api/logs`（止めなくてよい。印と記録"
"を、古い順の字で返す）。pagetray が起きない時は、止めたまま volume を別の "
"container に付けて読む（volume は、動いている container と同時には付けられな"
"い）:"
msgstr ""
"Read them with `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/api/logs` (no need to stop; it "
"returns the marks and the logs as text, oldest first). If pagetray does not "
"start, keep it stopped and attach the volume to another container to read "
"them (a volume cannot be attached to a second container while one is running "
"with it):"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"起きるたびに、前回の終わり方を 1 行で出す（`container logs pagetray` の頭と、"
"`server.log`）。"
msgstr ""
"On every start, pagetray prints one line about how the previous run ended "
"(at the top of `container logs pagetray`, and in `server.log`)."

#: src/run.md
