"（0.8.x までの置き場。答えを使わずに止まる）か、CLI が自分で組む道に、生成し"
"た層が 404 `UnknownOperationException` を返した（この CLI の呼ぶ操作を知らな"
"い、定義より古い置き場。`api` の道では code 1）"
msgstr ""
"The store's API is not the shape this CLI speaks: the answer carries a "
"`Pagetray-Api` header (a store up to 0.8.x; it stops without using the "
"answer), or the generated layer returned 404 `UnknownOperationException` on "
"a route the CLI builds itself (a store older than the model that does not "
"know the operation this CLI calls; code 1 on `api` routes)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`130`・`143`"
msgstr "`130`, `143`"

