#: src/api.md
msgid "共通"
msgstr "Common rules"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"受けるのは、この Mac の中からの要求だけ。`Host` が `127.0.0.1`・`localhost`"
"（port は何でもよい）でなければ `403`。`GET`・`HEAD` のほかの要求に `Origin` "
"が付いていれば `403`（browser の中のページからは書けない）。"
msgstr ""
"Only requests from this Mac are accepted. If `Host` is not `127.0.0.1` or "
"`localhost` (any port), the response is `403`. If a request other than `GET` "
"or `HEAD` carries `Origin`, the response is `403` (a page inside a browser "
"cannot write)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"その例外は 1 つだけ: 一覧の UI の Key の画面から file を上げる要求。`POST /"
"api/files` で、`Origin` が `http://<要求の Host（port も）>` とそのまま同じ"
"で、header `Sec-Fetch-Site` が無いか `same-origin` の時だけ通す。`Origin: "
"null`（本文の枠の中のページ）・ほかの port・ほかの名・`https://`・`Sec-Fetch-"
"Site: cross-site` は `403`。同じ `Origin` でも、ほかの道（`POST /api/pages`・"
"どの `DELETE` も）は `403`（一覧の UI からは、ページを置けず、何も消せな"
"い）。"
msgstr ""
"There is exactly one exception: a file upload from the Key view of the list "
"UI. It is let through only for `POST /api/files` whose `Origin` is exactly "
"`http://<the request's Host (with the port)>` and whose `Sec-Fetch-Site` "
"header is missing or `same-origin`. `Origin: null` (a page inside the "
"viewer), another port, another name, `https://`, and `Sec-Fetch-Site: cross-"
"site` get `403`. Even with the same `Origin`, other routes (`POST /api/"
"pages` and any `DELETE`) get `403` (the list UI cannot put pages or remove "
"anything)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"誤りの答えは `{\"error\":\"<人が読む文>\"}`。ただし、axum が自分で返す誤りは"
"この形でない: 引数を読めない（`limit=abc` など）`400` は平文（`text/"
"plain`）、道の無い path の `404` と、道にない method の `405`（`Allow` に受け"
"る method）は本文が空。"
msgstr ""
"An error response is `{\"error\":\"<human-readable message>\"}`. The "
"exception is errors that axum returns on its own: a `400` for parameters "
"that cannot be read (such as `limit=abc`) is plain text (`text/plain`), and "
"a `404` for a path with no route and a `405` for a method the route does not "
"take (`Allow` lists the methods it takes) have an empty body."

