msgstr ""
"The record of a page whose reply state has been written (`POST /api/pages/"
"reply` below) also carries the following fields (since 0.5.0; they are "
"absent on pages where it has not been written)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "欄"
msgstr "Field"

#: src/api.md src/db.md
msgid "`asked_at`"
msgstr "`asked_at`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "返事待ちにした時刻"
msgstr "When the page was marked as waiting for a reply"

#: src/api.md src/db.md
msgid "`answered_at`"
msgstr "`answered_at`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "答えた時刻。返事待ちの間は出ない"
msgstr "When it was answered. Absent while the page is waiting for a reply"

#: src/api.md src/db.md
msgid "`waits_on`"
msgstr "`waits_on`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"誰の返事を待つか（`review`・`tpm`）。Product Manager を待つページには出ない"
"（0.8.0 から）"
msgstr ""
"Whose reply the page is waiting for (`review` or `tpm`). Absent on pages "
"waiting for the Product Manager (since 0.8.0)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"レビューの印を書いたページ（下の `POST /api/pages/review`）の記録には、次の欄"
"も出る（0.8.0 から。書いていないページには出ない）。"
msgstr ""
"The record of a page whose review marks have been written (`POST /api/pages/"
"review` below) also carries the following fields (since 0.8.0; they are "
"absent on pages where they have not been written)."

#: src/api.md src/db.md src/next.md src/glossary.md
msgid "`verdict`"
msgstr "`verdict`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"レビューの判定（`approve`・`concerns`・`reject`・`not-assessed`）。`kind` が "
"`review` のページだけ"
msgstr ""
"The review verdict (`approve`, `concerns`, `reject`, `not-assessed`). Only "
"on pages whose `kind` is `review`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`targets`"
msgstr "`targets`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"見た物・見てほしい物の配列（書いた順）。置き場のページの path か、`https://` "
"の URL"
msgstr ""
"An array of what was reviewed or is to be reviewed (in the order written): a "
"path of a page in the store, or an `https://` URL"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"送り手を記録したページ（下の「送り手」）の記録には、`sender` の欄も出る"
"（0.6.0 から。記録していないページには出ない）。"
msgstr ""
"The record of a page whose sender was recorded (\"Senders\" below) also "
"carries the `sender` field (since 0.6.0; it is absent on pages without a "
"recorded sender)."

#: src/api.md src/next.md
msgid "送り手"
msgstr "Senders"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"ページと file を置く時に、呼ぶ側は、置く人を指す付随する id（`actor_issuer`・"
"`actor_ref`）を書ける（0.6.0 から。書かなくてよい）。置き場は、受けたその時"
"に [castlist](glossary.md)（アクターの本当の id と名を持つ、pagetray を動かす"
"機械の別の container のサーバー。聞く先は `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`）に送り手を"
"聞き、答えを残す。後から castlist の答えが変わっても、残した物は変えない。"
msgstr ""
"When putting a page or a file, the caller may write an attached id that "
"points to whoever puts it (`actor_issuer`, `actor_ref`) (since 0.6.0; "
"optional). At the moment it receives the request, the store asks [castlist]"
"(glossary.md) (a server in another container on the machine that runs "
"pagetray, holding the true id and name of each actor; the address asked is "
"`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`) for the sender and records the answer. Even if "
"castlist's answer changes later, what was recorded is not changed."

