msgstr "`issuer`, `ref`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "置く時に書いた `actor_issuer`・`actor_ref`"
msgstr "The `actor_issuer` and `actor_ref` written when it was put"

#: src/api.md src/next.md src/glossary.md
msgid "`actor`"
msgstr "`actor`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"castlist が答えたアクター（id・名・種類）。置き場に castlist の URL が無かっ"
"た時は `null`（未確認）"
msgstr ""
"The actor castlist answered with (id, name, kind). `null` (unconfirmed) when "
"the store had no castlist URL"

#: src/api.md src/db.md
msgid "`resolved_at`"
msgstr "`resolved_at`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"castlist が答えた時刻（castlist の答えの `as_of`）。聞かなかった時は出ない"
msgstr ""
"When castlist answered (`as_of` in castlist's answer). Absent when castlist "
"was not asked"

#: src/api.md
msgid "置き場が castlist に聞くかどうかと、答えで、置く要求の答えが決まる。"
msgstr ""
"Whether the store asks castlist, and what castlist answers, decide the "
"response to a put request."

#: src/api.md
msgid "場合"
msgstr "Case"

#: src/api.md
msgid "答え"
msgstr "Response"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`actor_issuer`・`actor_ref` が無い"
msgstr "No `actor_issuer` or `actor_ref`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "前と同じに置く（`sender` は出ない）"
msgstr "Stored as before (no `sender`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "置き場に castlist の URL（`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`）が無い"
msgstr "The store has no castlist URL (`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "置く。`sender.actor` は `null`"
msgstr "Stored. `sender.actor` is `null`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "castlist がアクターを答えた"
msgstr "castlist answered with an actor"

#: src/api.md
msgid "置く。`sender.actor` にその答え"
msgstr "Stored. `sender.actor` holds that answer"

#: src/api.md
msgid "castlist が `actor: null`（登録の無い送り手）を答えた"
msgstr "castlist answered `actor: null` (an unregistered sender)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`422`。何も置かない"
msgstr "`422`. Nothing is stored"

#: src/api.md
msgid "castlist につながらない・1 秒で答えない・`200` でない・答えが読めない"
msgstr ""
"castlist cannot be reached, does not answer within 1 second, does not return "
"`200`, or its answer cannot be read"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`503`。何も置かない。少し待ってから送り直す"
msgstr "`503`. Nothing is stored. Wait a little and send it again"

#: src/api.md
msgid "片方だけ書いた・形が違う時は `400`（castlist には聞かない）。"
msgstr ""
"If only one of the two is written, or the form is wrong, the response is "
"`400` (castlist is not asked)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"castlist には `POST /v1/resolve` で、`{\"issuer\":\"<actor_issuer>\","
"\"refs\":[\"<actor_ref>\"]}` を送る。`Host: 127.0.0.1` で送り、`Origin` は付"
"けない（castlist がほかの物を断る）。"
msgstr ""
"castlist is sent `POST /v1/resolve` with `{\"issuer\":\"<actor_issuer>\","
"\"refs\":[\"<actor_ref>\"]}`, with `Host: 127.0.0.1` and without `Origin` "
"(castlist rejects anything else)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "castlist を待つ間は、書く取引を始めない（ほかの置く要求を待たせない）。"
msgstr ""
"No write transaction is started while waiting for castlist (other put "
"requests are not kept waiting)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "file の記録"
msgstr "File record"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"置く・探すの答えに出る、file 1 つの記録（中身は入らない）。file は、ページか"
"ら参照する画像・PDF・字の file。"
msgstr ""
"The record of a single file, as it appears in put and list responses (the "
"contents are not included). Files are the images, PDFs and text files that "
"pages refer to."

