#: src/api.md
msgid "`POST /api/pages` — 置く"
msgstr "`POST /api/pages` — put"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（query）: `project`・`key`・`kind`・`role`（要る）、`workspace`（無けれ"
"ば空）、`n`・`created_at`（取り込みの時だけ）、`actor_issuer`・`actor_ref`"
"（送り手。両方書くか、両方書かない。0.6.0 から）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (query): `project`, `key`, `kind`, `role` (required); `workspace` "
"(empty if omitted); `n`, `created_at` (import only); `actor_issuer`, "
"`actor_ref` (the sender; write both or neither; since 0.6.0)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "本文: HTML（1 枚 16 MiB まで。空は駄目）。"
msgstr "Body: HTML (up to 16 MiB per page; must not be empty)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`n` が無ければ、その `project`・`key`・`kind` の「今の最大 ＋ 1」を付ける。最"
"大は、消したページの番号も数える（同じ番号を 2 度使わない）。"
msgstr ""
"If `n` is omitted, the page is given \"current maximum + 1\" for that "
"`project`, `key`, and `kind`. The maximum also counts the numbers of deleted "
"pages (the same number is never used twice)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`201`: ページの記録に `url`（要求の `Host` で組んだ URL）を足した JSON。"
"header `Location` も同じ URL。"
msgstr ""
"`201`: JSON of the page record plus `url` (a URL built from the request's "
"`Host`). The `Location` header carries the same URL."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`409`: `n` を名指して、その番号が使われている（置いてある・消した）。"
msgstr ""
"`409`: `n` was given explicitly and that number is already used (by a page "
"that is stored or was deleted)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`400`: 引数が決まりに合わない・本文が空・`actor_issuer` と `actor_ref` の片方"
"だけ。`413`: 本文が大きすぎる。"
msgstr ""
"`400`: a parameter violates the rules, the body is empty, or only one of "
"`actor_issuer` and `actor_ref` is given. `413`: the body is too large."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`422`: castlist に登録の無い送り手。`503`: castlist に聞けない（上の「送り"
"手」）。どちらも何も置かない。"
msgstr ""
"`422`: a sender not registered in castlist. `503`: castlist cannot be asked "
"(\"Senders\" above). In both cases nothing is stored."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/pages` — 探す"
msgstr "`GET /api/pages` — list"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（みな任意）: `project`・`key`・`kind`・`role`・`workspace`（同じ物だ"
"け）、`q`（題と本文の字を探す）、`sort`（`-created_at` 新しい順＝既定・"
"`created_at` 古い順）、`limit`（既定 100・1〜1000 に丸める）、`before`・"
"`after`（`created_at` がそれより前・後）、`reply`（返事の状態。`waiting` は返"
"事待ち、`answered` は答えた物だけ。0.5.0 から）、`on`（`reply` で絞る時の待ち"
"の相手。`pm`＝既定・`review`・`tpm`。0.8.0 から）、`verdict`（レビューの判"
"定。0.8.0 から）、`actor`（castlist のアクターの id。その送り手が置いた物だ"
"け。未確認の送り手は当たらない。0.6.0 から）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (all optional): `project`, `key`, `kind`, `role`, `workspace` "
"(exact match only), `q` (searches the text of the title and body), `sort` (`-"
"created_at` newest first = default, `created_at` oldest first), `limit` "
"(default 100; clamped to 1–1000), `before`, `after` (`created_at` earlier or "
"later than the given value), `reply` (the reply state: `waiting` for pages "
"waiting for a reply only, `answered` for answered pages only; since 0.5.0), "
"`on` (the waiting party when filtering with `reply`: `pm` = default, "
"`review`, `tpm`; since 0.8.0), `verdict` (the review verdict; since 0.8.0), "
"`actor` (a castlist actor id: only what that sender put; unconfirmed senders "
"never match; since 0.6.0)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`200`: `{\"pages\":[<ページの記録>, …]}`。合う物が無ければ空の配列。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: `{\"pages\":[<page record>, …]}`. An empty array if nothing matches."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`400`: `sort` がどちらでもない・`reply` がどちらでもない・`on` か `verdict` "
"が決まった名でない・`reply` の無い `on`。"
msgstr ""
"`400`: `sort` is neither of the two values, `reply` is neither of the two "
"values, `on` or `verdict` is not one of the defined names, or `on` is given "
"without `reply`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`on` を書かない `reply` は、今までどおり Product Manager の返事だけを見る（レ"
"ビューの待ちと上げた件は入らない）。"
msgstr ""
"`reply` without `on` looks only at replies from the Product Manager, as "
"before (reviews awaited and escalated items are not included)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`POST /api/pages/reply` — 返事の状態を書く"
msgstr "`POST /api/pages/reply` — write the reply state"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"Product Manager の返事が要るページに、返事待ち・答えたの状態を書く（0.5.0 か"
"ら）。`roster ask pm` が返事待ちにし、`roster answer` が答えたにする。一覧の "
"UI は、この状態で印と件数を出す。"
msgstr ""
"Writes the waiting / answered state on a page that needs a reply from the "
"Product Manager (since 0.5.0). `roster ask pm` marks a page as waiting and "
"`roster answer` marks it as answered. The list UI shows its marks and counts "
"from this state."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（query）: `project`・`key`・`kind`・`n`（ページ 1 枚を名指す）、`state`"
"（`waiting` 返事待ち・`answered` 答えた）は要る。`on`（待ちの相手。`pm` "
"Product Manager＝既定・`review` レビューの席・`tpm` TPM 担当。0.8.0 から）は"
"任意。本文は読まない。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (query): `project`, `key`, `kind`, `n` (naming one page), and "
"`state` (`waiting` or `answered`) are required. `on` (the waiting party: "
"`pm` the Product Manager = default, `review` the review seat, `tpm` the TPM "
"role; since 0.8.0) is optional. The body is not read."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`waiting`: `on` の相手の返事待ちにする。もう同じ相手の返事待ちなら何も変えな"
"い。今ほかの相手の返事待ちなら、何も変えずに `409`（待ちを黙って移さない）。"
"答えた後にもう 1 度書くと、`asked_at` が今になり、`answered_at` が消える（相"
"手も替えてよい）。"
msgstr ""
"`waiting`: marks the page as waiting for a reply from the `on` party. "
"Changes nothing if it is already waiting for the same party. If it is "
"waiting for another party, changes nothing and returns `409` (a wait is "
"never moved silently). Written again after an answer, `asked_at` becomes the "
"current time and `answered_at` is cleared (the party may change too)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`answered`: 答えたにする。もう答えていれば何も変えない。`on` の相手と、その"
"ページの待ちの相手が違えば、何も変えずに `409`。"
msgstr ""
"`answered`: marks the page as answered. Changes nothing if it is already "
"answered. If the `on` party differs from the waiting party of the page, "
"nothing changes and the response is `409`."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`on` が `pm`（書かない時）: 返事待ちにしていないページも答えたにでき、"
"`asked_at` にも同じ時刻が入る（0.5.0 からの形）。"
msgstr ""
"With `on` set to `pm` (or left out): a page that was never marked as waiting "
"can also be marked as answered, and `asked_at` gets the same time (the "
"behavior since 0.5.0)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`on` が `review`・`tpm`: その相手の返事待ちにしたページだけ。返事待ちにしてい"
"ないページは `409`（Product Manager の「答えた」に入れないため）。"
msgstr ""
"With `on` set to `review` or `tpm`: only a page marked as waiting for that "
"party. A page never marked as waiting gets `409` (so that it is not counted "
"as \"Answered\" for the Product Manager)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`200`: そのページの記録（`asked_at`・`answered_at` と、Product Manager のほか"
"を待つ物は `waits_on` が付く）。同じ状態を 2 度書いても同じ答え。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: the record of that page (with `asked_at` and `answered_at`, plus "
"`waits_on` on a page waiting on someone other than the Product Manager). "
"Writing the same state twice gives the same response."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`404`: そのページは無い（消した物も）。`409`: 待ちの相手が違う（何も変えてい"
"ない）。`400`: 引数が決まりに合わない。"
msgstr ""
"`404`: there is no such page (deleted pages included). `409`: the waiting "
"party differs (nothing changed). `400`: a parameter violates the rules."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"だれが書いてよいかは見ない（呼ぶ側が決める）。browser の中のページからは書け"
"ない（「共通」の `Origin` の決まり）。"
msgstr ""
"Who may write is not checked (the caller decides). A page inside a browser "
"cannot write (the `Origin` rule under \"Common\")."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"0.5.0 より前のサーバーには、このエンドポイントが無い（`404` か `405` が返"
"る）。呼ぶ側は、それを「状態を書けない置き場」として扱う。"
msgstr ""
"Servers before 0.5.0 do not have this endpoint (they return `404` or `405`). "
"A caller treats that as a store that cannot hold the state."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"0.8.0 より前のサーバーは、知らない `on` を読まずに捨て、Product Manager の返"
"事待ちにしてしまう。`on` を書く呼ぶ側は、先に `GET /api/version` で 0.8.0 以"
"上かを見る。"
msgstr ""
"Servers before 0.8.0 ignore an unknown `on` and mark the page as waiting for "
"the Product Manager instead. A caller that writes `on` first checks with "
"`GET /api/version` that the server is 0.8.0 or later."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`POST /api/pages/review` — レビューの印を書く"
msgstr "`POST /api/pages/review` — write the review marks"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"レビューのページに判定と見た物を、レビューの依頼書に見てほしい物を書く"
"（0.8.0 から）。`roster ask review`・`roster report review` が書く。一覧の "
"UI は、判定の印・見た物の link・見られたページの「レビュー:」を出す。"
msgstr ""
"Writes the verdict and targets on a review page, and the items to review on "
"a review brief (since 0.8.0). Written by `roster ask review` and `roster "
"report review`. The list UI shows the verdict mark, the target links, and "
"\"Review:\" on the pages that were reviewed."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（query。みな要る）: `project`・`key`・`kind`・`n`（ページ 1 枚を名指"
"す）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (query; all required): `project`, `key`, `kind`, `n` (naming one "
"page)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"本文（JSON。無くてもよい）: `{\"verdict\": \"<判定>\", \"targets\": [\"<見た"
"物>\", …]}`。どちらの欄も任意で、ほかの欄は受けない。"
msgstr ""
"Body (JSON; may be absent): `{\"verdict\": \"<verdict>\", \"targets\": "
"[\"<target>\", …]}`. Both fields are optional, and no other fields are "
"accepted."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`verdict`: `approve`・`concerns`・`reject`・`not-assessed` のどれか。`kind` "
"が `review` のページだけに書ける。書けば替わり、書かなければ前の物のまま。"
msgstr ""
"`verdict`: one of `approve`, `concerns`, `reject`, `not-assessed`. Can be "
"written only on a page whose `kind` is `review`. When written, it replaces "
"the old one; when left out, the previous one stays."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`targets`: 置き場のページの path（`/<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html`。"
"`http://…` の URL のままは受けない）か、`https://` で始まる URL（2048 字ま"
"で。空白と制御の字は駄目）。足すだけで、同じ物は 1 つ。ページ 1 枚に 100 個ま"
"で（足すと超える要求は、判定も含めて何も変えずに `400`）。外す道は無い。ペー"
"ジを消すと一緒に消える。"
msgstr ""
"`targets`: each either a path of a page in the store (`/<project>/<key>/"
"<kind>-<n>.html`; the `http://…` URL of it is not accepted as is) or a URL "
"starting with `https://` (up to 2048 characters; no whitespace or control "
"characters). They are only ever added, and duplicates are kept once. A page "
"holds up to 100 (a request that would exceed this changes nothing, the "
"verdict included, and returns `400`). There is no way to remove them. They "
"are deleted together with the page."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`200`: そのページの記録（`verdict`・`targets` が付く）。"
msgstr "`200`: the record of that page (with `verdict` and `targets`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`404`: そのページは無い。`400`: 引数・本文が決まりに合わない。"
msgstr ""
"`404`: there is no such page. `400`: a parameter or the body violates the "
"rules."

#: src/api.md
msgid "0.8.0 より前のサーバーには、このエンドポイントが無い（`405` が返る）。"
msgstr "Servers before 0.8.0 do not have this endpoint (they return `405`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`DELETE /api/pages` — 消す"
msgstr "`DELETE /api/pages` — delete"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数: `project`（要る）、`key`・`kind`・`n`（任意。`n` を書く時は `key` と "
"`kind` も要る）。合うページをみな消す。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters: `project` (required); `key`, `kind`, `n` (optional; when `n` is "
"given, `key` and `kind` are also required). Deletes every matching page."

#: src/api.md
msgid "本文は残さない（戻せない）。番号は残り、同じ番号は 2 度使わない。"
msgstr ""
"The body is not kept (it cannot be restored). The number remains, and the "
"same number is never used twice."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`200`: `{\"removed\":[\"<path>\", …]}`。合う物が無ければ空の配列。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: `{\"removed\":[\"<path>\", …]}`. An empty array if nothing matches."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`400`: 引数が決まりに合わない。"
msgstr "`400`: a parameter violates the rules."

#: src/api.md
msgid "だれが消してよいかは見ない（呼ぶ側が決める）。"
msgstr "The server does not check who is allowed to delete (callers decide)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html` — 本文"
msgstr "`GET /<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html` — body"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`200`: 置いた HTML をそのまま（`Content-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8`、"
"`Content-Security-Policy: sandbox allow-scripts`）。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: the HTML exactly as it was put (`Content-Type: text/html; "
"charset=utf-8`, `Content-Security-Policy: sandbox allow-scripts`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`404`: 無い。`410`: 消した。"
msgstr "`404`: does not exist. `410`: deleted."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`POST /api/files` — file を置く"
msgstr "`POST /api/files` — put a file"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（query）: `project`・`key`・`name`（`<語>.<拡張子>`）・`role`（要る）、"
"`workspace`（無ければ空）、`n`・`created_at`（取り込みの時だけ）、"
"`actor_issuer`・`actor_ref`（送り手。`POST /api/pages` と同じ。0.6.0 から）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (query): `project`, `key`, `name` (`<stem>.<ext>`), `role` "
"(required); `workspace` (empty if omitted); `n`, `created_at` (import only); "
"`actor_issuer`, `actor_ref` (the sender; same as `POST /api/pages`; since "
"0.6.0)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"本文: file の中身そのもの（1 つ 16 MiB まで。空は駄目）。header `Content-"
"Type` が要る。"
msgstr ""
"Body: the file contents as is (up to 16 MiB per file; must not be empty). "
"The `Content-Type` header is required."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`n` が無ければ、その `project`・`key`・語・拡張子の「今の最大 ＋ 1」を付ける"
"（`screen.png` を置くと `screen-1.png`、もう 1 度置くと `screen-2.png`。前の"
"物は残る）。最大は、消した file の番号も数える。"
msgstr ""
"Without `n`, the file gets \"current maximum + 1\" for that `project`, "
"`key`, stem and extension (putting `screen.png` gives `screen-1.png`; "
"putting it again gives `screen-2.png`, and the earlier one stays). The "
"maximum also counts the numbers of deleted files."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`201`: file の記録に `url`（要求の `Host` で組んだ URL）を足した JSON。"
"header `Location` も同じ URL。"
msgstr ""
"`201`: JSON of the file record plus `url` (a URL built from the request's "
"`Host`). The `Location` header carries the same URL."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`409`: `n` を名指して、その番号が使われている（置いてある file・消した "
"file）。"
msgstr ""
"`409`: `n` was given explicitly and that number is already used (by a file "
"that is stored or was deleted)."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`400`: 引数が決まりに合わない・本文が空・`Content-Type` が無い・"
"`actor_issuer` と `actor_ref` の片方だけ。`413`: 本文が大きすぎる。"
msgstr ""
"`400`: a parameter violates the rules, the body is empty, `Content-Type` is "
"missing, or only one of `actor_issuer` and `actor_ref` is given. `413`: the "
"body is too large."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`422`・`503`: 送り手を castlist に聞いた答え（上の「送り手」）。castlist に"
"は、ほかの決まり（`400`・`415`）を見終えてから聞く。"
msgstr ""
"`422`, `503`: the result of asking castlist for the sender (\"Senders\" "
"above). castlist is asked only after the other rules (`400`, `415`) have "
"been checked."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`415`: 拡張子を受けない、`Content-Type` の種類（`;` の前。大文字・小文字は問"
"わない）が拡張子の物と違う、中身が拡張子の形でない。"
msgstr ""
"`415`: the extension is not accepted, the media type of `Content-Type` (the "
"part before `;`, compared case-insensitively) differs from the extension's, "
"or the contents do not match the extension."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"一覧の UI から上げた物（上の「共通」の例外）は、引数に何が書いてあっても、"
"`role` を `product-manager`、`workspace` を空で記録する（browser から担当を名"
"乗らせない）。`n`・`created_at`・`actor_issuer`・`actor_ref` も読まない（番号"
"と時刻は置き場が決め、送り手は記録しない）。`role` は書かなくてよい。"
msgstr ""
"An upload from the list UI (the exception under \"Common rules\" above) is "
"recorded with `role` `product-manager` and an empty `workspace`, whatever "
"the arguments say (a browser cannot claim to be a role). `n`, `created_at`, "
"`actor_issuer`, and `actor_ref` are ignored too (the store decides the "
"number and the time, and no sender is recorded). `role` may be left out."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/files` — file を探す"
msgstr "`GET /api/files` — list files"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数（みな任意）: `project`・`key`・`role`・`workspace`（同じ物だけ）、`q`"
"（名 `<語>.<拡張子>` の字を探す）、`actor`・`sort`・`limit`・`before`・"
"`after`（`GET /api/pages` と同じ）。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters (all optional): `project`, `key`, `role`, `workspace` (exact "
"match only), `q` (searches the name `<stem>.<ext>`), `actor`, `sort`, "
"`limit`, `before`, `after` (same as `GET /api/pages`)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "file の記録にも、送り手を記録した物には `sender` が出る（0.6.0 から）。"
msgstr ""
"File records, too, carry `sender` when a sender was recorded (since 0.6.0)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`200`: `{\"files\":[<file の記録>, …]}`。合う物が無ければ空の配列。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: `{\"files\":[<file record>, …]}`. An empty array if nothing matches."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`400`: `sort` がどちらでもない。"
msgstr "`400`: `sort` is neither of the two values."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`DELETE /api/files` — file を消す"
msgstr "`DELETE /api/files` — delete files"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"引数: `project`（要る）、`key`・`name`（`<語>.<拡張子>`）・`n`（任意。`n` を"
"書く時は `key` と `name` も要る）。合う file をみな消す。"
msgstr ""
"Parameters: `project` (required); `key`, `name` (`<stem>.<ext>`), `n` "
"(optional; when `n` is given, `key` and `name` are also required). Deletes "
"every matching file."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"中身は残さない（戻せない）。番号は残り、同じ番号は 2 度使わない。ページは消さ"
"ない（ページを消しても file は消えない）。"
msgstr ""
"The contents are not kept (they cannot be restored). The number remains, and "
"the same number is never used twice. Pages are not deleted (and deleting a "
"page does not delete files)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /<project>/<key>/files/<語>-<n>.<拡張子>` — file の中身"
msgstr "`GET /<project>/<key>/files/<stem>-<n>.<ext>` — file contents"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`200`: 置いた中身をそのまま。`Content-Type` は上の表の物、`Content-Security-"
"Policy: sandbox`（直に開いても script は動かない）、`X-Content-Type-Options: "
"nosniff`、`Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable`（同じ URL の中身は変わ"
"らない）。"
msgstr ""
"`200`: the stored contents as is. `Content-Type` is the one from the table "
"above, with `Content-Security-Policy: sandbox` (scripts do not run even when "
"opened directly), `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`, and `Cache-Control: max-"
"age=31536000, immutable` (the contents at a URL never change)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "そのほか"
msgstr "Others"

#: src/api.md
msgid "仕様"
msgstr "Specification"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`200` と `ok`"
msgstr "`200` and `ok`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "入る"
msgstr "Covered"

#: src/api.md
msgid "サーバーの版と API の版"
msgstr "Server version and API version"

#: src/api.md
msgid "DB の写し（SQLite の file 1 つ）"
msgstr "Backup of the DB (a single SQLite file)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/logs`"
msgstr "`GET /api/logs`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"残した記録（終わり方の印と、時刻つきの行）を、古い順の字で返す（0.7.0 から。"
"`text/plain`。多くて 4 MiB と 64 KiB）。中身の形は [動かす](run.md) の「落ち"
"た後に調べる」"
msgstr ""
"Returns the kept logs (the run marks and the timestamped lines) as text, "
"oldest first (since 0.7.0; `text/plain`; at most 4 MiB plus 64 KiB). The "
"contents are described in \"Investigating after a crash\" in [Running]"
"(run.md)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "URL が開くことと、字で返ることだけ。行の形は入らない"
msgstr ""
"Only that the URL opens and returns text. The format of the lines is not "
"covered"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"置かれるたび・返事の状態が書かれるたびに 1 件を push（SSE）。ページは名の無"
"い event でページの記録、file は `event: file` で file の記録、返事の状態は "
"`event: reply` でページの記録（0.5.0 から）、レビューの印は `event: review` "
"でページの記録（0.8.0 から）"
msgstr ""
"Pushes one event each time something is put or a reply state is written "
"(SSE): an unnamed event with the page record for a page, `event: file` with "
"the file record for a file, `event: reply` with the page record for a reply "
"state (since 0.5.0), and `event: review` with the page record for review "
"marks (since 0.8.0)"

#: src/api.md src/glossary.md
msgid "一覧の UI"
msgstr "List UI"

#: src/api.md
msgid "URL が開くことだけ。HTML の作りは入らない"
msgstr "Only that the URL opens. The HTML structure is not covered"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"image と、release に付ける CLI の binary は public で、だれでも取って中を見ら"
"れる。**出すのは release の workflow（`.github/workflows/release.yml`）だけ**"
"で、手元から `push` せず、release に file を手で付けない（手元の build には、"
"commit していない file と、自分の home の path が入りうる）。"
msgstr ""
"The image and the CLI binary attached to a release are public, and anyone "
"can get them and look inside. **Only the release workflow (`.github/"
"workflows/release.yml`) publishes them**; never `push` from your local "
"machine and never attach files to a release by hand (a local build can "
"include files that are not committed, and the path of your own home "
"directory)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"`Cargo.toml` の `[workspace.package]` の `version` を上げ、`CHANGELOG.md` に"
"節を足す PR を merge する。"
msgstr ""
"Merge a PR that bumps `version` under `[workspace.package]` in `Cargo.toml` "
"and adds a section to `CHANGELOG.md`."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"main のその commit に tag を打って push する: `git tag v<version> && git "
"push origin v<version>`。"
msgstr ""
"Tag that commit on main and push the tag: `git tag v<version> && git push "
"origin v<version>`."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"workflow の `check` が、tag と版が合うか・image の中身の一覧・設定・秘密の走"
"査（下の「image に入る物」）・動くかを見る。`check-cli` が、CLI の binary の"
"形・つながる library・版・秘密の走査（下の「release に付ける CLI に入る"
"物」）・動くかを見る。**1 つでも落ちれば、`push` は動かず、image も CLI も出"
"ない。**"
msgstr ""
"The workflow's `check` verifies that the tag matches the version, the "
"image's contents list, its configuration, the secret scan (see \"What goes "
"into the image\" below), and that the image runs. `check-cli` verifies the "
"CLI binary's format, linked libraries, version, the secret scan (see \"What "
"goes into the CLI attached to a release\" below), and that it runs. **If "
"even one of these fails, `push` does not run, and neither the image nor the "
"CLI is published.**"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"`push` が、確かめたその image（作り直さない）を `ghcr.io/uraitakahito/"
"pagetray:v<version>` に置き、release に digest と中身の一覧を書き、確かめたそ"
"の CLI の tar と checksum を付ける。同じ tag がもうあれば置かない。"
msgstr ""
"`push` pushes that verified image (without rebuilding it) to `ghcr.io/"
"uraitakahito/pagetray:v<version>`, writes the digest and the contents list "
"to the release, and attaches that verified CLI tar and its checksum. If the "
"same tag already exists, it does not push."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"release の中身の一覧が「`pagetray-server` と空の `data` だけ」であることと、"
"付いた file が `pagetray-v<version>-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz` とその "
"`.sha256` の 2 つだけであることを見る（この時、image も CLI ももう public。"
"違っていたら、すぐ下の「機微な物が出てしまった時」をする）。"
msgstr ""
"Check that the contents list in the release is \"only `pagetray-server` and "
"an empty `data`\", and that the attached files are only `pagetray-v<version>-"
"aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz` and its `.sha256` (at this point the image and "
"the CLI are already public; if anything differs, do \"If something sensitive "
"got out\" just below)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"roster の `.pagetray-version` を上げる PR を出す（つなぎの試験が、その image "
"に向けて通る）。"
msgstr ""
"Open a PR that bumps `.pagetray-version` in roster (the integration tests "
"run against that image and pass)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"出した tag は打ち直さない（digest が変わり、書き留めた値と合わなくなる）。直"
"す時は、次の版を出す。"
msgstr ""
"Never re-tag a published tag (the digest changes and no longer matches the "
"recorded value). To fix something, publish the next version."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**rc**: tag に `-rc.` の付く物（`v<版>-rc.<n>`。`Cargo.toml` の版も "
"`CHANGELOG.md` の節も `<版>-rc.<n>`）は、GitHub の pre-release にする。作り方"
"と確かめは、ほかの tag と同じ。"
msgstr ""
"**rc**: A tag with `-rc.` (`v<version>-rc.<n>`; the version in `Cargo.toml` "
"and the section in `CHANGELOG.md` are also `<version>-rc.<n>`) becomes a "
"GitHub pre-release. It is built and checked the same way as any other tag."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**どの tag も新しい server と新しい CLI（1.0.0 から。AI-36）**: image は "
"`Containerfile`（新しい server の `pagetray-next` を `/pagetray-server` の名"
"で置く）で作り、`ci/smoke-image.sh <image> next` で確かめる。release に付け"
"る CLI は `crates/cli-next`（binary `pagetray`）。smoke は、新しい API の形で"
"置いて読むほかに、下の「切り替え」の 2・3 の予行も流す: ghcr.io から今の版の "
"image（v0.8.0。`ci/smoke-image.sh` の `old_image` に digest で固める）を取"
"り、今の API でページ・file を置き、ページと file を 1 つずつ足して消し、返事"
"の状態とレビューの印を付けて写しを取り、確かめる image の migrate で新しい "
"volume に移し、照らしの行がみな ok で、新しい API で同じ物が読め、消した URL "
"が 410 で、次に置くページが消した番号を使わないかを見る。だから release の確"
"かめは、ghcr.io の v0.8.0 の image に頼る（下の「機微な物が出てしまった時」"
"で v0.8.0 を消すなら、先に予行を替える PR を出す）。"
msgstr ""
"**Every tag uses the new server and the new CLI (since 1.0.0; AI-36)**: The "
"image is built with `Containerfile` (which puts the new server's `pagetray-"
"next` in place under the name `/pagetray-server`) and checked with `ci/smoke-"
"image.sh <image> next`. The CLI attached to a release is `crates/cli-next` "
"(binary `pagetray`). Besides storing and reading in the new API shape, the "
"smoke test also rehearses steps 2 and 3 of \"The switch-over\" below: it "
"pulls the current version's image from ghcr.io (v0.8.0, pinned by digest in "
"`old_image` in `ci/smoke-image.sh`), stores pages and a file through the "
"current API, adds and deletes one page and one file, sets a reply state and "
"review marks, takes a copy, moves it into a new volume with the checked "
"image's migrate, and checks that every check line is ok, that the same items "
"read back through the new API, that the deleted URLs return 410, and that "
"the next stored page does not reuse a deleted number. So the release checks "
"depend on the v0.8.0 image on ghcr.io (if v0.8.0 is deleted under \"If "
"something sensitive got out\" below, first open a PR that changes the "
"rehearsal)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**今の server（0.8.x）と今の CLI は、もう出さない**: 1.0.0 から "
"`Containerfile` は新しい server を作り、今の CLI（`crates/cli`）は消したの"
"で、今の server を直して出す道は無い。直しが要れば、新しい server で直して次"
"の版を出す。戻す時に使う今の版は v0.8.0 のままなので、smoke の予行の "
"`old_image` も替えない。今の server の code（`src/` など）と "
"`Containerfile.next` は段 9 で消す。"
msgstr ""
"**The current server (0.8.x) and the current CLI are no longer published**: "
"From 1.0.0, `Containerfile` builds the new server and the current CLI "
"(`crates/cli`) has been removed, so there is no way to publish a fix of the "
"current server. If a fix is needed, fix the new server and publish the next "
"version. The current version used for rolling back stays v0.8.0, so "
"`old_image` in the smoke rehearsal is not changed either. The current "
"server's code (`src/` and so on) and `Containerfile.next` are removed in "
"stage 9."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**切り替え（0.8.x から 1.0.0 に上げる時。AI-36 の段 8）**: 1.0.0 の image の"
"中の binary も `/pagetray-server` で、環境変数と port も同じなので、[動かす]"
"(run.md) の命令で 0.8.x と替わるのは image の版と、**volume** だけ。手順 6"
"（roster の `.pagetray-version` を上げる）は、3 の後、新しい volume で起こし"
"てからする（先に上げると、roster が 0.8.x の置き場に新しい API で話す）。"
msgstr ""
"**The switch-over (upgrading from 0.8.x to 1.0.0; stage 8 of AI-36)**: The "
"binary inside the 1.0.0 image is also `/pagetray-server`, and the "
"environment variables and ports are the same, so the only things that differ "
"from 0.8.x in the commands in [Running](run.md) are the image version and "
"the **volume**. Do step 6 (raising roster's `.pagetray-version`) after step "
"3, once the store is running on the new volume (raising it first makes "
"roster speak the new API to the 0.8.x store)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**volume は新しい物（`pagetray-data-v1`）にする。新しい server を、今の "
"volume（`pagetray-data`）で起こさない。** 今の DB は新しい server の形でない"
"（新しい server は、今の server の移行を当てた DB を、何も書かずに断って止ま"
"る）。今の volume は、戻す時のために、そのまま残す。"
msgstr ""
"**Use a new volume (`pagetray-data-v1`). Do not start the new server on the "
"current volume (`pagetray-data`).** The current DB is not in the new "
"server's shape (the new server refuses a DB that has the current server's "
"migrations applied, writing nothing, and stops). Keep the current volume as "
"it is, for rolling back."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"先にデータを移す: 今の server の `GET /api/backup` で写しを取り（止める直前"
"に。[動かす](run.md) の「DB の写しを取る」）、今の container を止めて消してか"
"ら、1.0.0 の image に `migrate --from <写し> --to /data/pages.db` を付けて、"
"新しい volume と写しの folder を付けて起こす（例 `container run --rm -v "
"pagetray-data-v1:/data -v \"<backup-dir>:/in:ro\" ghcr.io/uraitakahito/"
"pagetray:v1.0.0 migrate --from /in/<backup-file> --to /data/pages.db`）。写し"
"は `-wal`・`-shm` の無い 1 つの file で渡す。表ごとの行の数と digest・本文の "
"SHA-256 などの突き合わせ（[新しい API の形](next.md) の「データ」）が 1 つで"
"も合わなければ、何も足さずに 1 で終わる（新しい volume に作りかけた DB は消"
"す）。**1 で終わったら 3 に進まない。** 訳を直してから、もう 1 度 2 をする。"
"出た行は、予行の時と見比べられるように残す。"
msgstr ""
"Move the data first: take a copy with the current server's `GET /api/backup` "
"(right before stopping it; \"Back up the DB\" in [Running](run.md)), stop "
"and remove the current container, then start the 1.0.0 image with `migrate --"
"from <copy> --to /data/pages.db`, with the new volume and the copy's folder "
"attached (for example `container run --rm -v pagetray-data-v1:/data -v "
"\"<backup-dir>:/in:ro\" ghcr.io/uraitakahito/pagetray:v1.0.0 migrate --from /"
"in/<backup-file> --to /data/pages.db`). Pass the copy as a single file with "
"no `-wal` or `-shm`. If even one of the checks (row counts and digests per "
"table, the SHA-256 of the bodies, and so on; see \"Data\" in [The new API "
"shape](next.md)) does not match, it adds nothing and exits with 1 (the half-"
"made DB on the new volume is removed). **If it exits with 1, do not go on to "
"3.** Fix the cause, then do 2 again. Keep the printed lines so that they can "
"be compared with the dry run."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"移し終えてから、新しい volume で 1.0.0 を起こす（[動かす](run.md) の「起こ"
"す」）。"
msgstr ""
"After the move is done, start 1.0.0 on the new volume (\"Start\" in [Running]"
"(run.md))."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"戻す時は、1.0.0 を止めて消し、v0.8.0 の image と今の volume（`pagetray-"
"data`）で起こす。切り替えから戻すまでに 1.0.0 に置いた物は、今の volume に入"
"らない。0.8.x の置き場には、0.8.x の release の CLI を使う。"
msgstr ""
"To roll back, stop and remove 1.0.0, and start the v0.8.0 image with the "
"current volume (`pagetray-data`). What was stored on 1.0.0 between the "
"switch-over and the rollback does not get into the current volume. For a "
"0.8.x store, use the CLI from the 0.8.x release."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**機微な物が出てしまった時**: GitHub の package の画面で、その版を消す。CLI "
"の方なら、release の画面で付いた file を消す。秘密なら、すぐ替える（消して"
"も、pull した人の手元には残る前提で動く）。直して次の版を出し、`ci/` の決まり"
"に、同じ物を止める形を足す。"
msgstr ""
"**If something sensitive got out**: Delete that version on the GitHub "
"package page. For the CLI, delete the attached files on the release page. If "
"it is a secret, rotate it immediately (act on the assumption that it remains "
"on the machines of people who pulled it, even after deletion). Fix the "
"problem and publish the next version, and add something to the rules in `ci/"
"` that blocks the same thing."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"**置いた時から public**: この repo は public で、image に repo を指す label "
"を付けて置くので、package は初めの release から、だれでも pull できる"
"（v0.2.0 で確かめた。private の間に人が見る、という段は無い）。人が見られるの"
"は、tag を打つ前だけ。だから、3 の確かめを push の前に置いてあり、決まりを緩"
"める PR（`ci/` の file・`.dockerignore`・`Containerfile`）は、よく見てから "
"merge する。CLI の binary も、release に付いた時から public。"
msgstr ""
"**Public from the moment it is pushed**: This repo is public, and the image "
"is pushed with a label pointing to the repo, so the package can be pulled by "
"anyone from the very first release (verified with v0.2.0; there is no stage "
"where a person reviews it while it is still private). A person can review it "
"only before the tag is created. That is why the checks in step 3 are placed "
"before the push, and why PRs that loosen the rules (files in `ci/`, "
"`.dockerignore`, `Containerfile`) are reviewed carefully before merging. The "
"CLI binary is also public from the moment it is attached to a release."

#: src/release.md
msgid "image に入る物"
msgstr "What goes into the image"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"image は外に出す物なので、入ってよい物を決めてあり、CI（`ci/check-image.sh`）"
"が毎回確かめる。1 つでも違えば落ちる。`Containerfile.next`（1.0.0 から "
"`Containerfile` と同じ中身。段 9 で消す）も同じ決まりで、CI の job `image-"
"next` が確かめる。"
msgstr ""
"Because the image is published externally, what may go into it is defined, "
"and CI (`ci/check-image.sh`) verifies it every time. If even one thing "
"differs, it fails. `Containerfile.next` (the same contents as "
"`Containerfile` from 1.0.0; removed in stage 9) follows the same rules, and "
"CI's job `image-next` verifies it."

#: src/release.md
msgid "見る物"
msgstr "Checked item"

#: src/release.md
msgid "書いてある所"
msgstr "Defined in"

#: src/release.md
msgid "build の中に入る物"
msgstr "What goes into the build"

#: src/release.md
msgid "名指した source だけ（履歴・CI の設定・試験・手元の file は入れない）"
msgstr ""
"Only the explicitly named sources (no history, CI configuration, tests, or "
"local files)"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`.dockerignore`"
msgstr "`.dockerignore`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "image の file"
msgstr "Files in the image"

#: src/release.md
msgid "binary 1 つ（`pagetray-server`）と、空の `/data` だけ。layer は 2 枚"
msgstr "Only one binary (`pagetray-server`) and an empty `/data`. Two layers"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/image-contents.txt`"
msgstr "`ci/image-contents.txt`"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"環境変数は DB の path と待ち受けの 2 つだけ。label は "
"`org.opencontainers.image.source`・`version`・`revision` だけ。開ける port "
"は 8080 だけ"
msgstr ""
"Only two environment variables: the DB path and the listen address. Only the "
"labels `org.opencontainers.image.source`, `version`, and `revision`. Only "
"port 8080 is exposed"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/check-image.sh` の頭"
msgstr "Top of `ci/check-image.sh`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "binary の中の字"
msgstr "Strings in the binary"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"home の path・mail の形・秘密の鍵や token の頭が無い。gitleaks も掛ける"
"（source にも）"
msgstr ""
"No home paths, email-like strings, or prefixes of secret keys or tokens. "
"gitleaks is also run (on the source as well)"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/strings-deny.txt`・`ci/strings-allow.txt`"
msgstr "`ci/strings-deny.txt`, `ci/strings-allow.txt`"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"build に秘密は要らない。`Containerfile` に `ARG` を書かず、`--build-arg`・`--"
"secret` を使わない。label は、release の workflow が `--label` で付ける 3 つ"
"だけ。"
msgstr ""
"The build needs no secrets. Do not write `ARG` in the `Containerfile`, and "
"do not use `--build-arg` or `--secret`. The only labels are the three that "
"the release workflow adds with `--label`."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"出どころの記録（provenance・SBOM）は付けない。付ける時は、中身を見てから。"
msgstr ""
"No origin records (provenance, SBOM) are attached. If you add them, inspect "
"their contents first."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"release の workflow は、確かめる job（書き込みの権限が無い）と、置く job"
"（`packages: write`）に分かれている。置く job は、確かめた image の file を受"
"け取って、そのまま置く。"
msgstr ""
"The release workflow is split into a job that verifies (with no write "
"permission) and a job that pushes (`packages: write`). The pushing job "
"receives the verified image file and pushes it as is."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"本物の DB やその写しを、この repo にも CI にも置かない（`.gitignore` と "
"`.dockerignore` が `*.db` を外す）。"
msgstr ""
"Never put a real DB or a backup of one in this repo or in CI (`.gitignore` "
"and `.dockerignore` exclude `*.db`)."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"決まりを変える時（file を足す・通す字を足す）は、PR で見える形で上の file を"
"直す。"
msgstr ""
"To change the rules (adding a file, adding an allowed string), edit the "
"files above in a PR, where the change is visible."

#: src/release.md
msgid "release に付ける CLI に入る物"
msgstr "What goes into the CLI attached to a release"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"CLI（`pagetray`。macOS の arm64 用）も外に出す物なので、image と同じに、入っ"
"てよい物を決めてある。CI の job `cli` が PR ごとに、release の `check-cli` が"
"出す前に、同じ script で確かめる。1 つでも違えば落ちる。"
msgstr ""
"The CLI (`pagetray`, for macOS arm64) is also something that goes out, so, "
"as with the image, what may go into it is fixed. The CI job `cli` verifies "
"it on every PR, and the release's `check-cli` verifies it before publishing, "
"with the same scripts. If even one thing differs, it fails."

#: src/release.md
msgid "build"
msgstr "build"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"home と repo の path を、決まった名に付け替えて作る（Rust は source の path "
"を binary に埋め込むので、そのままだと build した人の home の path が出る）。"
"秘密は渡さない"
msgstr ""
"Built with the home and repo paths remapped to fixed names (Rust embeds "
"source paths in the binary, so otherwise the home path of whoever built it "
"would get out). No secrets are passed"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/build-cli.sh`"
msgstr "`ci/build-cli.sh`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "binary の形"
msgstr "Binary format"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"macOS の arm64 の実行 file。つながる library は OS の物だけ。`--version` が "
"`Cargo.toml` の版と同じ"
msgstr ""
"A macOS arm64 executable. The only linked libraries are those of the OS. `--"
"version` matches the version in `Cargo.toml`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/check-cli.sh`・`ci/cli-libs.txt`"
msgstr "`ci/check-cli.sh`, `ci/cli-libs.txt`"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"image の binary と同じ決まり（home の path・mail の形・秘密の鍵や token の頭"
"が無い。gitleaks も掛ける）。同じ script を使う"
msgstr ""
"The same rules as the image's binary (no home paths, no email-like strings, "
"no private-key or token prefixes; gitleaks is run as well). The same script "
"is used"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/scan-binary.sh`・`ci/strings-deny.txt`・`ci/strings-allow.txt`"
msgstr "`ci/scan-binary.sh`, `ci/strings-deny.txt`, `ci/strings-allow.txt`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "tar の中身"
msgstr "Contents of the tar"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"`pagetray` と `LICENSE` だけ。持ち主は `root`/`wheel` に固定し、macOS が足す"
"付け足しの file を入れない"
msgstr ""
"Only `pagetray` and `LICENSE`. The owner is fixed to `root`/`wheel`, and the "
"extra files macOS adds are left out"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`ci/pack-cli.sh`・`ci/cli-contents.txt`"
msgstr "`ci/pack-cli.sh`, `ci/cli-contents.txt`"

#: src/release.md
msgid "動くか"
msgstr "Whether it runs"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"その binary を、同じ commit の新しい server に向けて打つ（CLI の試験。"
"`PAGETRAY_TEST_BIN` に出す binary を渡す）"
msgstr ""
"That binary is run against the new server from the same commit (the CLI "
"tests; the published binary is passed in `PAGETRAY_TEST_BIN`)"

#: src/release.md
msgid "`crates/cli-next/tests/`"
msgstr "`crates/cli-next/tests/`"

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"`check-cli` は、書き込みの権限も秘密も持たない。`push` は、渡された tar の "
"checksum を見てから、作り直さずに release に付ける。"
msgstr ""
"`check-cli` has neither write permission nor secrets. `push` verifies the "
"checksum of the tar handed to it and attaches it to the release without "
"rebuilding."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"CLI は、認証の token も設定の file も持たない。build の時に binary に焼き込む"
"値は、版だけ。"
msgstr ""
"The CLI holds neither an authentication token nor a configuration file. The "
"only value baked into the binary at build time is the version."

#: src/release.md
msgid ""
"署名は linker が付ける ad-hoc の物だけで、公証はしていない。出どころの記録"
"（provenance）も付けない。"
msgstr ""
"The only signature is the ad-hoc one added by the linker; it is not "
"notarized. No provenance record is attached either."

#: src/development.md
msgid "ファイル"
msgstr "File"

#: src/development.md
