msgstr "`src/main.rs`"

#: src/development.md
msgid ""
"今の server（0.8.x）の、設定を読む・起こす・止める（binary の名は `pagetray-"
"server`）。`src/` と `migrations/` は今の server の物で、1.0.0 からは image "
"に入らず、移す試験の元を作るのに使う（段 9 で消す）"
msgstr ""
"Reads the settings, starts, and stops the current server (0.8.x) (the binary "
"is named `pagetray-server`). `src/` and `migrations/` belong to the current "
"server; from 1.0.0 they are not in the image and are used to make the "
"sources for the migration tests (removed in stage 9)"

