"が付随する id（`actor_issuer`・`actor_ref`）を書けば、置くたびに 1 行足す。置"
"き場に castlist の URL（[動かす](run.md) の表の「設定」）があれば、その時に "
"castlist に聞いた答え（アクターの id・名・種類）も残す。"
msgstr ""
"One row per sender of a put page or file (since 0.6.0). When the caller "
"writes an attached id (`actor_issuer`, `actor_ref`) at put time, one row is "
"added for each put. If the store has a castlist URL (\"Settings\" in the "
"table in [Running](run.md)), the answer castlist gave at that time (the "
"actor's id, name, and kind) is recorded too."

