#: src/next.md
msgid "新しい API の形（作り直しの間の設計）"
msgstr "The new API shape (design during the rewrite)"

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"AI-36 の作り直しで、pagetray の API を Smithy の定義（`model/`）から作る。こ"
"の章は、新しい server（`crates/server`）が従う形を先に決めておく物。切り替え"
"の後は、[API の仕様](api.md) の章をこの形に書き直し、この章は消す。"
msgstr ""
"In the AI-36 rewrite, the pagetray API is built from a Smithy model (`model/"
"`). This chapter fixes in advance the shape that the new server (`crates/"
"server`) follows. After the switch-over, the [API specification](api.md) "
"chapter is rewritten in this shape and this chapter is removed."

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"今の API との互換は守らない（Product Manager の決め: AI-36）。守るのは、デー"
"タ（ページと file の行・番号・消した番号）と、そこから決まる振る舞い（番号は "
"2 度使わない・消したページは 410・本文は置いたままの byte で返す など）と、"
"ページと file の URL の形。"
msgstr ""
"Compatibility with the current API is not kept (Product Manager's decision: "
"AI-36). What is kept is the data (the rows of pages and files, their "
"numbers, and the removed numbers), the behavior that follows from it (a "
"number is never used twice, a removed page is 410, a body comes back byte "
"for byte as it was put, and so on), and the shape of the page and file URLs."

#: src/next.md
msgid "共通の決まり（castlist と同じ）"
msgstr "Common rules (the same as castlist)"

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"castlist の [新しい API の形](https://github.com/uraitakahito/castlist/blob/"
"main/docs/src/next.md) の「共通の決まり」と同じ決まりに従う。共通の形（誤り・"
"時刻・ページ送り）は、castlist の定義の `ai.common` を、castlist の release "
"の tag で固めて取る（下の「定義の取り方」）。"
msgstr ""
"pagetray follows the same rules as the \"common rules\" in castlist's [new "
"API shape](https://github.com/uraitakahito/castlist/blob/main/docs/src/"
"next.md). The common shapes (errors, time, paging) are castlist's "
"`ai.common`, fetched and pinned at a castlist release tag (see \"How the "
"model is fetched\" below)."

