#: src/next.md
msgid "時刻"
msgstr "Time"

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 の UTC（末尾 `Z`。`ai.common#DateTime`）。時差の付いた時刻"
"（`+09:00`）は生成した層が 400 で断る。残す字は UTC・ミリ秒まで・24 字"
"（`2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z`）にそろえ、字の順が時刻の順になる"
msgstr ""
"RFC 3339 in UTC (ending in `Z`; `ai.common#DateTime`). A time with an offset "
"(`+09:00`) is refused with 400 by the generated layer. Stored strings are "
"normalized to UTC, to the millisecond, 24 characters "
"(`2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z`), so string order is time order"

#: src/next.md
msgid "誤り"
msgstr "Errors"

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"定義に書いた型だけ: 400 `ValidationException`・404 `NotFound`・409 "
"`Conflict`・410 `Gone`・415 `UnsupportedMediaType`（`ai.pagetray` の型。file "
"の種類を受けない。下の「file を置く」）・500 `InternalError`（server の中の失"
"敗。訳は記録に書き、答えは決まった字。`@retryable` は付けない）・503 "
"`Unavailable`（混んでいる・時間切れ・呼ぶ先の castlist が答えない。"
"`@retryable`）。守りの層が断る 403 `Forbidden`・413 `PayloadTooLarge`・503 "
"`Unavailable` は、service の `errors` に置き、どの操作の誤りにも入る。生成し"
"た層の外の道（本文・SSE・backup・logs）の誤りも、同じ形で返す。生成した層が自"
"分で返す物は、知らない道の 404 `UnknownOperationException`（本文は `{}`）・読"
"めない引数の 400 `SerializationException`・違う `Content-Type` の 415 "
"`UnsupportedMediaTypeException`"
msgstr ""
"Only the types written in the model: 400 `ValidationException`, 404 "
"`NotFound`, 409 `Conflict`, 410 `Gone`, 415 `UnsupportedMediaType` (a type "
"of `ai.pagetray`; the file type is not accepted; see \"Putting a file\" "
"below), 500 `InternalError` (a failure inside the server; the reason goes to "
"the log and the response is a fixed message; no `@retryable`), 503 "
"`Unavailable` (busy, timed out, or castlist not answering; `@retryable`). "
"The 403 `Forbidden`, 413 `PayloadTooLarge`, and 503 `Unavailable` that the "
"guard layer returns are in the service's `errors`, so they are part of every "
"operation's errors. Routes outside the generated layer (bodies, SSE, backup, "
"logs) return errors in the same shape. The generated layer itself returns "
"404 `UnknownOperationException` for an unknown route (the body is `{}`), 400 "
"`SerializationException` for parameters it cannot read, and 415 "
"`UnsupportedMediaTypeException` for a wrong `Content-Type`"

