#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"手の道（Smithy の外）: ページの本文 `GET /{project}/{key}/{kind}-{n}.html`・"
"file の中身 `GET /{project}/{key}/files/{語}-{n}.{拡張子}`（どちらも今と同じ "
"URL）・新着の知らせ `GET /api/events`（SSE）・`GET /api/backup`・`GET /api/"
"logs`・画面（`/`・`/{project}/`・`/{project}/{key}/`）。"
msgstr ""
"Hand-written routes (outside Smithy): page bodies `GET /{project}/{key}/"
"{kind}-{n}.html`, file contents `GET /{project}/{key}/files/{word}-{n}."
"{extension}` (both the same URLs as now), new-arrival notices `GET /api/"
"events` (SSE), `GET /api/backup`, `GET /api/logs`, and the UI (`/`, `/"
"{project}/`, `/{project}/{key}/`)."

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"置かれたページの URL は切らない。だから本文の URL は今のまま、Smithy の外の手"
"の道にする（`.html` の付いた 1 段は、Smithy の道の label にできない）。"
msgstr ""
"The URLs of pages already put must not break. So the body URLs stay as they "
"are, as hand-written routes outside Smithy (a path segment ending in `.html` "
"cannot be a Smithy label)."

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"`/api/` の下の道は、みな生成した層か、名指した手の道に行く。本文の道（`/"
"{project}/{key}/{file}`）は `/api/…` を受けない（`project` に `api` は置けな"
"い）。"
msgstr ""
"Every path under `/api/` goes to the generated layer or to a named hand-"
"written route. The body route (`/{project}/{key}/{file}`) does not take `/"
"api/…` (no page can have the `project` `api`)."

#: src/next.md
msgid "この章の操作と手の道は、みな作ってある。"
msgstr "All the operations and hand-written routes in this chapter are built."

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"`GET /api/backup`（`crates/server/src/hand.rs`）: 今の server と同じ。DB の隣"
"の一時の file（`<DB>.backup-<pid>-<番号>`）に `VACUUM INTO` で揃ったバック"
"アップを作り、開いてから名を消し（作る・開く・名を消すは別の task でするの"
"で、写しを作る間に時間切れで 503 を返しても、client が切っても、一時の file "
"は残らない。止める合図で、写しを作る途中に process が終わった時だけは残り得"
"る）、`application/vnd.sqlite3`（`Content-Disposition: attachment; "
"filename=\"pages.db\"`）で読みながら送る。読む接続で作る（今の server は書く"
"接続。写しを作る間、書く物を待たせない）。誤りは restJson1 の形の 503 "
"`Unavailable`・500 `InternalError`。時間切れは答えの頭まで（写しを作る間）を"
"数え、送る間は数えない（下の「守りの層」）。写しを作るのに 5 秒を過ぎれば "
"503 `Unavailable`。"
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/backup` (`crates/server/src/hand.rs`): same as the current server. "
"It makes a consistent backup with `VACUUM INTO` in a temporary file next to "
"the DB (`<DB>.backup-<pid>-<seq>`), opens it, removes the name (making, "
"opening and removing the name run in a separate task, so the temporary file "
"is not left behind even when the timeout answers 503 while the copy is being "
"made, or the client hangs up; it can be left behind only when the process "
"ends on a stop signal in the middle of making the copy), and streams it as "
"`application/vnd.sqlite3` (`Content-Disposition: attachment; "
"filename=\"pages.db\"`). It is made on a read connection (the current server "
"uses the write connection; writers are not kept waiting while the copy is "
"made). Errors are a 503 `Unavailable` or a 500 `InternalError` in the "
"restJson1 shape. The timeout counts up to the response head (while the copy "
"is made), not the time spent sending (see \"Guard layer\" below). If making "
"the copy takes more than 5 seconds, the answer is a 503 `Unavailable`."

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"`GET /api/logs`: 今の server と同じ字（`text/plain; charset=utf-8`。印と、古"
"い順の記録）。記録の置き場が無い時（Router を直に呼ぶ試験）は、今の server と"
"同じく 404（形は restJson1 の `NotFound`）。"
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/logs`: the same text as the current server (`text/plain; "
"charset=utf-8`; the run marks, then the log lines oldest first). Without a "
"log place (tests that call the Router directly), it is a 404, as on the "
"current server (in the restJson1 `NotFound` shape)."

#: src/next.md
msgid "ページを置く（CreatePage）"
msgstr "Putting a page (CreatePage)"

