"crate・新しい server の土台（生成した層の包み・守りの層の Host と Origin と頭"
"の印と時間切れ・誤り・DB）・`CreatePage`・ページの本文の道"
msgstr ""
"This chapter, the model (`GetHealth`, `CreatePage`), `ci/gen.sh`, the two "
"generated crates, the base of the new server (the wrapper of the generated "
"layer; Host and Origin, header stamps, and timeout of the guard layer; "
"errors; DB), `CreatePage`, and the page body route"

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
"送り手（`actorIssuer`・`actorRef` を受け、castlist を生成した client で引く）"
msgstr ""
"Senders (accept `actorIssuer` and `actorRef`, and look them up in castlist "
"with the generated calling crate)"

