msgstr ""
"Files (`CreateFile`, `ListFiles`, `DeleteFiles`, the file contents route, "
"and the exception for the list UI), and the guard layer's body limit (moved "
"from 5 so that it is checked together with the file limit)"

#: src/next.md
msgid ""
