"の `ui` が、今の server と新しい server の両方に流す）"
msgstr ""
"The push of new arrivals (SSE), the screens, and a minimal startup binary "
"just enough to run the e2e tests (CI's `ui` job runs them against both the "
"current and the new server)"

#: src/next.md
