#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"pagetray の文書・画面・code で使う語を、1 か所に並べる。語を足す・替える時"
"は、先にここを直し、文書と code をそれに合わせる。"
msgstr ""
"The terms used in pagetray's documents, UI, and code are listed here in one "
"place. When adding or changing a term, fix this page first, then make the "
"documents and the code match it."

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "**語**: 文書で使う語。かっこの中は、英語の本と code で使う語。"
msgstr "**Term**: The term used in the documents and in the code."

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"**code の名**: HTML の id（`#…`）・class（`.…`）・型・欄・命令など。無ければ"
"「—」。"
msgstr ""
"**Name in code**: An HTML id (`#…`), a class (`.…`), a type, a field, a "
"command, and so on. \"—\" if there is none."

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"**使わない言い方**: 前に使っていた語や、ほかの物と紛れる語。文書にも註にも書"
"かない。"
msgstr ""
"**Terms to avoid**: Terms used earlier, or terms that can be confused with "
"something else. They are not written in documents or comments."

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"[roster](https://github.com/uraitakahito/roster) の語（担当・依頼書・控えな"
"ど）は、roster の docs にある。"
msgstr ""
"The terms of [roster](https://github.com/uraitakahito/roster) (roles, "
"briefs, local copies, and so on) are in the roster docs."

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "置き場の物"
msgstr "Things in the store"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "語"
msgstr "Term"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "code の名"
msgstr "Name in code"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "使わない言い方"
msgstr "Terms to avoid"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "置き場（store）"
msgstr "store"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "ページを DB に持ち、番号を付けて返す、このサーバーのこと"
msgstr "This server, which keeps pages in a DB, numbers them, and returns them"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "pagestore"
msgstr "pagestore"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "サーバー（server）"
msgstr "server"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`pagetray-server`"
msgstr "`pagetray-server`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "置き場の本体。container の中で動く binary"
msgstr "The store itself. The binary that runs inside the container"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`pagetray`"
msgstr "`pagetray`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "置き場を端末から操作する命令"
msgstr "The command for operating the store from a terminal"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "ページ（page）"
msgstr "page"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`pages`"
msgstr "`pages`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "置き場に置く HTML 1 枚。置き直すと、別の番号の別のページになる"
msgstr ""
"One HTML document put into the store. Putting it again makes a different "
"page with a different number"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "Artifact"
msgstr "Artifact"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "本文（body）"
msgstr "body"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "ページの HTML そのもの"
msgstr "The HTML of the page itself"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "ページの記録（page record）"
msgstr "page record"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`PageRecord`"
msgstr "`PageRecord`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"ページ 1 枚の、本文を除いた欄（project・Key・種類・番号・題・役割・"
"workspace・時刻・大きさ・path。返事の状態を書いたページには、その時刻も。送り"
"手を記録したページには、送り手も）"
msgstr ""
"The fields of one page other than its body (project, Key, kind, number, "
"title, role, workspace, time, size, path; plus the reply-state times on "
"pages where that state has been written, and the sender on pages where a "
"sender was recorded)"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "メタデータ"
msgstr "metadata"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "返事の状態（reply state）"
msgstr "Reply state"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`asked_at`・`answered_at`"
msgstr "`asked_at`, `answered_at`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"返事が要るページに、呼ぶ側が書く状態。返事待ち（`waiting`。求めて、まだ答えて"
"いない）か、答えた（`answered`）。書いていないページは、返事を求めていない"
msgstr ""
"The state a caller writes on a page that needs a reply: waiting (`waiting`: "
"asked, not answered yet) or answered (`answered`). A page where it has not "
"been written asks for no reply"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "待ちの相手（waiting party）"
msgstr "waiting party"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`waits_on`・`on`"
msgstr "`waits_on`, `on`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"返事の状態が、誰の返事を待つか。Product Manager（`pm`。DB では空）・レビュー"
"の席（`review`）・TPM 担当（`tpm`）。「返事待ち」「答えた」と言う時は、"
"Product Manager の物"
msgstr ""
"Whose reply a reply state waits for: the Product Manager (`pm`; null in the "
"DB), the review seat (`review`), or the TPM role (`tpm`). \"Waiting for "
"reply\" and \"Answered\" on their own refer to the Product Manager"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "レビューの判定（verdict）"
msgstr "verdict"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"レビューのページに、呼ぶ側が書く判定。よい（`approve`）・気になる所あり"
"（`concerns`）・直すべき（`reject`）・見られなかった（`not-assessed`）"
msgstr ""
"The verdict a caller writes on a review page: good (`approve`), has concerns "
"(`concerns`), should be fixed (`reject`), or could not be assessed (`not-"
"assessed`)"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "見た物（target）"
msgstr "target"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`page_targets`・`targets`"
msgstr "`page_targets`, `targets`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"レビューのページが見た物・レビューの依頼書が見てほしい物。置き場のページの "
"path か、`https://` の URL（PR など）。1 枚にいくつでも"
msgstr ""
"What a review page looked at, or what a review brief asks to be looked at: a "
"path of a page in the store, or an `https://` URL (such as a PR). Any number "
"per page"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "レビュー待ち（awaiting review）"
msgstr "awaiting review"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`on=review`"
msgstr "`on=review`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"レビューの席の判定を待っている状態。レビューの依頼書に付き、判定が返ると「レ"
"ビュー済み」になる"
msgstr ""
"The state of waiting for the verdict of the review seat. It is set on a "
"review brief, and becomes \"Reviewed\" when the verdict comes back"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "上げた（escalated）"
msgstr "escalated"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`on=tpm`"
msgstr "`on=tpm`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"レビューの判定を受けずに、課題の担当が TPM 担当へ上げ、まだ決まっていない状"
"態。レビューのページに付き、決まると「決まった」になる"
msgstr ""
"The state where the role in charge of the issue did not accept the review "
"verdict and escalated it to the TPM role, and it is not decided yet. It is "
"set on a review page, and becomes \"Decided\" once decided"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "project"
msgstr "project"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"ページをまとめる、いちばん上の名。`roster` は、project の folder の path から"
"作る"
msgstr ""
"The topmost name that groups pages. `roster` builds it from the path of the "
"project folder"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "Key"
msgstr "Key"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "課題の名（`AI-22` など）。project の下でページをまとめる"
msgstr ""
"The name of an issue (such as `AI-22`). It groups pages under a project"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "鍵"
msgstr "—"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "種類（kind）"
msgstr "kind"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "ページの種類の名（`plan`・`result` など）。名の一覧は、呼ぶ側が決める"
msgstr ""
"The name of the kind of a page (such as `plan` or `result`). The caller "
"decides the list of names"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "type"
msgstr "type"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "番号（number）"
msgstr "number"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"project・Key・種類ごとに、置き場が 1 から付ける数。消した番号は 2 度使わない"
msgstr ""
"The number the store assigns, starting at 1, per project, Key, and kind. A "
"deleted number is never used twice"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "version"
msgstr "version"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "役割（role）"
msgstr "role"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"ページを置いた人の役割の名（`tpm`・`human` など）。画面の見出しは「担当者（役"
"割）」"
msgstr ""
"The name of the role of whoever put the page (such as `tpm` or `human`). The "
"heading in the UI reads \"Assignee (role)\""

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "workspace"
msgstr "workspace"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "ページを置いた人の居場所の ID"
msgstr "The ID of the workspace of whoever put the page"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "castlist"
msgstr "castlist"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`・`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`, `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"pagetray を動かす機械で、別の container として動くサーバー。アクター（Claude "
"Code の session 1 つ・Product Manager）ごとに、本当の id と名を持つ。置き場"
"は、置かれる時に、送り手が誰かを castlist に聞く（聞く先は "
"`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`）。一覧の UI は、送り手の名から castlist のアクターの"
"画面へ link する（link の頭は `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL`）"
msgstr ""
"A server that runs as another container on the machine that runs pagetray. "
"It holds the true id and name of each actor (one Claude Code session, or the "
"Product Manager). When something is put, the store asks castlist who the "
"sender is (at `PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_URL`). The list UI links the sender's name "
"to the actor's page in castlist (the link base is "
"`PAGETRAY_CASTLIST_LINK_URL`)"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "アクター（actor）"
msgstr "actor"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"castlist が本当の id と名を付けた、置く人 1 人（Claude Code の session 1 つ"
"か、Product Manager）"
msgstr ""
"One person who puts things, given a true id and name by castlist (one Claude "
"Code session, or the Product Manager)"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "付随する id（attached id）"
msgstr "attached id"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`actor_issuer`・`actor_ref`"
msgstr "`actor_issuer`, `actor_ref`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"ほかの道具が持つ、アクターを指す id（`<種類>:<値>`。`claude.session:…` など）"
"と、それを出した物（`tpm` など）。本当の id への引き当ては castlist がする"
msgstr ""
"An id held by another tool that points to an actor (`<type>:<value>`, such "
"as `claude.session:…`), and what issued it (such as `tpm`). castlist maps it "
"to the true id"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "送り手（sender）"
msgstr "sender"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`senders`"
msgstr "`senders`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"ページか file を置いた時の、付随する id と、その時に castlist が答えたアク"
"ター（id・名・種類）。castlist に聞かなかった送り手は「未確認」。足すだけで、"
"書き換えも消しもしない"
msgstr ""
"The attached id given when a page or a file was put, and the actor castlist "
"answered with at that time (id, name, kind). A sender for which castlist was "
"not asked is \"unconfirmed\". Only added, never rewritten or deleted"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`files`"
msgstr "`files`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"ページから参照する file（画像・PDF・字の file）1 つ。置き直すと、別の番号の別"
"の file になる"
msgstr ""
"One file (an image, a PDF, or a text file) referenced from pages. Putting it "
"again makes a different file with a different number"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "消した番号（removed number）"
msgstr "removed number"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`removed`・`files_removed`"
msgstr "`removed`, `files_removed`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"消したページと file の番号。本文は持たない。同じ番号を 2 度使わないためと、消"
"した URL に `410` を返すために残す"
msgstr ""
"The numbers of removed pages and files, without their bodies. Kept so that "
"no number is used twice and so that a removed URL returns `410`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "全文の索引（full-text index）"
msgstr "full-text index"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`pages_fts`"
msgstr "`pages_fts`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"ページの題と本文の字を、3 字ずつに切って引けるようにした索引（SQLite の "
"FTS5）。探す欄の語は、ここで引く"
msgstr ""
"An index (SQLite FTS5) that splits page titles and body text into 3-"
"character pieces for lookup. Words in the search field are looked up here"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "移行（migration）"
msgstr "migration"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"DB の表を作る・変える SQL。サーバーが起きる時に、まだ当てていない物を番号の順"
"に当てる。当てた物は変えない"
msgstr ""
"SQL that creates or changes the DB tables. On startup, the server applies "
"those not yet applied, in number order. Applied ones are never edited"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "写し（backup）"
msgstr "backup"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`pagetray backup`"
msgstr "`pagetray backup`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "DB をそのまま写した、SQLite の file 1 つ"
msgstr "A single SQLite file that is a copy of the DB as it is"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "バックアップ"
msgstr "—"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`/api/…`"
msgstr "`/api/…`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "置き場が、呼ぶ側に向けて開けている HTTP の受け先の全体"
msgstr "The whole of the HTTP receivers the store opens to callers"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "口"
msgstr "—"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "エンドポイント（endpoint）"
msgstr "endpoint"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "API の受け先の 1 つ 1 つ（`POST /api/pages` など）"
msgstr "Each single receiver of the API (such as `POST /api/pages`)"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "API の仕様（API specification）"
msgstr "API specification"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`docs/src/api.md`"
msgstr "`docs/src/api.md`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "呼ぶ側が頼ってよい形を書いた章"
msgstr "The chapter that describes the shapes callers may rely on"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "口の約束"
msgstr "API contract"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "API の版（API version）"
msgstr "API version"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`API_VERSION`"
msgstr "`API_VERSION`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"API の形を、前からある呼ぶ側が困るように変えた時だけ上げる数。どの答えにも "
"header `Pagetray-Api` で付く"
msgstr ""
"A number bumped only when the shape of the API changes in a way that breaks "
"existing callers. It is attached to every response in the `Pagetray-Api` "
"header"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "口の版"
msgstr "—"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "呼ぶ側（caller）"
msgstr "caller"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "API を呼ぶ物（CLI・`roster page` など）"
msgstr "Whatever calls the API (the CLI, `roster page`, and so on)"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "クライアント"
msgstr "client"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"区画の名は、**働き ＋ 形**（帯・列・枠）で付ける。位置（上・左・右）では呼ば"
"ない（狭い画面では、区画が縦に積まれるため）。区画を足す時も、同じ形で名を付"
"け、ここに 1 行足す。"
msgstr ""
"The regions are named by **function + shape** (bar, column, frame). They are "
"not named by position (top, left, right), because on a narrow screen the "
"regions stack vertically. When adding a region, name it in the same form and "
"add a row here."

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "一覧の UI（list UI）"
msgstr "list UI"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`templates/index.html`"
msgstr "`templates/index.html`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "browser で開く、置き場の画面の全体"
msgstr "The whole screen of the store, opened in a browser"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "操作の帯（toolbar）"
msgstr "toolbar"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`#toolbar`"
msgstr "`#toolbar`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"画面のいちばん上の横の帯。題・探す欄・並び・返事待ちの数・レビュー待ちの数・"
"上げた数・新着の印がある"
msgstr ""
"The horizontal bar at the very top of the screen. It holds the title, the "
"search field, the sort order, the waiting count, the review-waiting count, "
"the escalated count, and the new-arrival mark"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "ヘッダー"
msgstr "header"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "絞り込みの列（filter column）"
msgstr "filter column"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`#filters`"
msgstr "`#filters`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"返事・判定・送り手・役割・workspace・種類・Key・project の候補と件数が並ぶ"
"列。候補を押すと、一覧の列が絞られる"
msgstr ""
"The column listing the choices and counts for reply state, verdict, sender, "
"role, workspace, kind, Key, and project. Pressing a choice narrows the list "
"column"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "サイドメニュー"
msgstr "side menu, sidebar"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "一覧の列（list column）"
msgstr "list column"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`#list`"
msgstr "`#list`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "ページの行が並ぶ列。行を押すと、そのページが本文の枠に出る"
msgstr ""
"The column listing the rows of pages. Pressing a row shows that page in the "
"viewer"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "リスト"
msgstr "—"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "本文の枠（viewer）"
msgstr "viewer"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`#viewer`"
msgstr "`#viewer`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "選んだページの path と本文を、1 枚だけ出す枠"
msgstr ""
"The frame that shows the path and body of the chosen page, one page only"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "右の枠"
msgstr "right frame, preview"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "Key の画面（Key view）"
msgstr "Key view"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`KeyView`"
msgstr "`KeyView`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"project と Key を 1 つずつ選んだ一覧の UI（`/<project>/<key>/` など）。file "
"の枠と上げる枠が足される"
msgstr ""
"The list UI with exactly one project and one Key chosen (such as `/<project>/"
"<key>/`). It adds the file box and the upload box"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "file の枠（file box）"
msgstr "file box"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`#files`"
msgstr "`#files`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"Key の画面で、一覧の列の下に出る枠。その Key の file が、図の見本・名・大き"
"さ・上げた人・時刻・ページから参照する path と並ぶ"
msgstr ""
"The box below the list column in the Key view. It lists the files of that "
"Key with a thumbnail, the name, the size, who uploaded it, the time, and the "
"path a page uses to refer to it"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "上げる枠（upload box）"
msgstr "upload box"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`#upload`"
msgstr "`#upload`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"Key の画面で、file の枠の下に出る枠。file を選ぶか落とし、見本を見て、見た印"
"を付けてから送る"
msgstr ""
"The box below the file box in the Key view. You choose or drop a file, look "
"at the preview, and send it after ticking the reviewed check"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "見た印（reviewed check）"
msgstr "reviewed check"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`reviewed`"
msgstr "`reviewed`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "上げる枠の「秘密が写っていないか見た」の check。付けるまで送れない"
msgstr ""
"The \"I checked that no secrets are in it\" checkbox in the upload box. "
"Nothing can be sent until it is ticked"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "絞り込み（filter）"
msgstr "filter"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`FilterGroup`"
msgstr "`FilterGroup`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "一覧の列に出す行を、条件で減らすこと。条件は URL に出る"
msgstr ""
"Reducing the rows shown in the list column by conditions. The conditions "
"appear in the URL"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "フィルター"
msgstr "—"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "候補（choice）"
msgstr "choice"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`Choice`"
msgstr "`Choice`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "絞り込みの列に出る、押せる値の 1 つ（値と件数）"
msgstr "One pressable value shown in the filter column (a value and its count)"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "facet"
msgstr "facet"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "行（row）"
msgstr "row"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`.rows`"
msgstr "`.rows`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"一覧の列の中の、ページ 1 枚分（時刻・Key・種類と番号・判定の印・返事の印・"
"題・役割・workspace。見た物を書いたページには見た物の link、レビューで見られ"
"たページにはそのレビューの link。送り手を記録したページには、送り手の "
"castlist の名と付随する id）"
msgstr ""
"One page's worth of the list column (time, Key, kind and number, verdict "
"mark, reply mark, title, role, workspace; on pages where targets were "
"written, also the target links, and on pages that a review looked at, links "
"to those reviews; on pages where a sender was recorded, also the sender's "
"castlist name and attached id)"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "並び（sort order）"
msgstr "sort order"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "一覧の列の行の順。新しい順か、古い順"
msgstr "The order of the rows in the list column: newest first or oldest first"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "ソート"
msgstr "—"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "新着の印（new-arrival mark）"
msgstr "new-arrival mark"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`#fresh`"
msgstr "`#fresh`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"開いている間にページが置かれると、一覧の列と絞り込みの列は押さずに新しくな"
"る。一覧の列を下へ送っている時は、操作の帯にこの印が出て、押すと一覧の列の頭"
"へ送る。「続きを出す」で古い方を見ている時は、押すと読み直す。数えるのは、今"
"の絞り込みで一覧の列に入ったページだけ"
msgstr ""
"When a page is put while the screen is open, the list column and the filter "
"column are updated without pressing anything. While the list column is "
"scrolled down, this mark appears in the toolbar, and pressing it scrolls the "
"list column to its top. While an older part is shown with \"Show more\", "
"pressing it reloads. Only pages that entered the list column under the "
"current filters are counted"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "通知"
msgstr "notification"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "返事待ちの数（waiting count）"
msgstr "Waiting count"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`#waiting`"
msgstr "`#waiting`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"操作の帯に出る「返事待ち N 件」。返事待ちのページが置き場に 1 枚でもあると出"
"て、押すと返事待ちだけに絞る。数は、絞り込みに関わらず置き場の全部。tab の題"
"にも同じ数が出る"
msgstr ""
"The count of waiting pages shown in the toolbar. It appears when at least "
"one page in the store is waiting for a reply, and pressing it narrows the "
"list to the waiting pages. The count covers the whole store regardless of "
"filters. The tab title shows the same count"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "レビュー待ちの数（review-waiting count）"
msgstr "Review-waiting count"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`#review-waiting`"
msgstr "`#review-waiting`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"操作の帯に出る「レビュー待ち N 件」。レビュー待ちの依頼書が置き場に 1 枚でも"
"あると出て、押すとそれだけに絞る。数は、絞り込みに関わらず置き場の全部"
msgstr ""
"The \"Awaiting review: N\" count shown in the toolbar. It appears when at "
"least one brief in the store is awaiting review, and pressing it narrows the "
"list to those briefs. The count covers the whole store regardless of filters"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "上げた数（escalated count）"
msgstr "Escalated count"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`#escalated`"
msgstr "`#escalated`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"操作の帯に出る「上げた N 件」。上げて、まだ決まっていないレビューが 1 つでも"
"あると出て、押すとそれだけに絞る"
msgstr ""
"The \"Escalated: N\" count shown in the toolbar. It appears when at least "
"one review has been escalated and not decided yet, and pressing it narrows "
"the list to those reviews"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "返事の印（reply mark）"
msgstr "Reply mark"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`.reply`"
msgstr "`.reply`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"返事の状態を書いたページの行に付く印。待ちの相手ごとに「返事待ち」「答え"
"た」・「レビュー待ち」「レビュー済み」・「上げた」「決まった」。状態が書かれ"
"ると、押さずに替わる"
msgstr ""
"The mark on the row of a page whose reply state has been written. Depending "
"on the waiting party, it reads \"Waiting for reply\" or \"Answered\", "
"\"Awaiting review\" or \"Reviewed\", or \"Escalated\" or \"Decided\". It "
"changes without a click when the state is written"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "判定の印（verdict mark）"
msgstr "Verdict mark"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`.verdict`"
msgstr "`.verdict`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"判定を書いたレビューのページの行と、見られたページの行の「レビュー:」に付く"
"印。「よい」「気になる所あり」「直すべき」「見られなかった」を、字と色で出す"
msgstr ""
"The mark on the row of a review page with a verdict, and on \"Review:\" in "
"the row of a reviewed page. It shows \"Good\", \"Concerns\", \"Fix needed\", "
"or \"Not assessed\" in text and color"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "見た物の link（target links）"
msgstr "target links"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`.links`"
msgstr "`.links`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"行の下に出る link の並び。レビューのページは「見た物:」、依頼書は「見る"
"物:」、見られたページは「レビュー:」。置き場のページは本文の枠に、PR は別の "
"tab に開く"
msgstr ""
"The row of links shown below a row: \"Reviewed:\" on a review page, \"To "
"review:\" on a brief, and \"Review:\" on a reviewed page. A page in the "
"store opens in the viewer, and a PR opens in another tab"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "未読の印（unread mark）"
msgstr "unread mark"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "`.unread`"
msgstr "`.unread`"

#: src/glossary.md
msgid ""
"まだ本文の枠に出していない、後から置かれたページの行に付く印。browser が覚え"
"る"
msgstr ""
"The mark on the row of a page that was put later and has not yet been shown "
"in the viewer. The browser remembers it"
